ent": {"type": "table", "table": [["filepaths", "['/mnt/user-data/outputs/ZombieWave-Fixed.zip']"]]}, "approval_options": null, "approval_key": null, "approval_key_legacy": null, "is_mcp_app": null, "hidden_in_chat": null, "mcp_server_url": null, "tool_origin": "first_party"}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:23:58.345265Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:23:58.345322Z", "flags": null, "type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01SPtuq5sqDiYsuB3BJsWzS4", "name": "present_files", "content": [{"type": "local_resource", "file_path": "/mnt/user-data/outputs/ZombieWave-Fixed.zip", "name": "ZombieWave-Fixed", "mime_type": "application/zip", "artifact_publishable": false}, {"type": "text", "text": "\n\nThe file cards appear with your reply, and where they sit relative to its text depends on the app the user is reading in; finish the reply with text, and refer to a file by its name, never as above or below."}], "is_error": false, "structured_content": null, "meta": {"output_format_category": "other"}, "message": "Presented file", "integration_name": "File Creation", "mcp_server_url": null, "integration_icon_url": null, "icon_name": "file", "display_content": null, "hidden_in_chat": null, "tool_origin": "first_party"}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:24:06.122608Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:24:08.353283Z", "flags": null, "type": "text", "text": "Cada arquivo do zip tem o nome do script e a pasta do Studio onde ele vai (as pastas do zip seguem o Explorer); apague o `BuildClient` antigo de StarterPlayerScripts e use o `BuildUIController` novo dentro de `StarterGui/BuildUI`. N\u00e3o consegui rodar nada no Studio, ent\u00e3o o c\u00f3digo n\u00e3o foi testado.\n\n**Problemas encontrados e corrigidos:**\n- **PlayerData:** faltavam `SpendMoney`, `AddMoney`, `GetUpgrade`, `SetUpgrade`, `ApplyStats`, `GetDamageMult` e o `leaderstats`. A loja e a constru\u00e7\u00e3o quebravam. Agora tamb\u00e9m tem XP, level, kills e autosave com retry.\n- **Remotes:** `Upgrade` era RemoteEvent mas usava `OnServerInvoke`. `Notify` e `BuyItem` nem existiam. Todos criados com o tipo certo.\n- **MainServer e BuildService:** o `workspace.Structures` n\u00e3o existia, ent\u00e3o o require travava para sempre. O `BuildService.Start()` nunca era chamado, ent\u00e3o torretas, spikes, minas e esta\u00e7\u00e3o de cura n\u00e3o funcionavam.\n- **Config:** as chaves duplicadas com espa\u00e7o (\"Wood Wall\") geravam atributos inv\u00e1lidos. Ficaram s\u00f3 ids limpos.\n- **ZombieService:** faltavam `IsZombie`, `Damage`, `NearestZombie` e `ZombiesInRadius`, ent\u00e3o o tiro dava erro. Os zumbis ignoravam o Config, n\u00e3o atacavam nem davam recompensa, e bosses n\u00e3o existiam. Reescrito com IA, ataque a paredes, slam do boss e rewards.\n- **WaveService:** ignorava o Config, spawnava s\u00f3 o tipo \"Normal\" e refazia a vota\u00e7\u00e3o e o mapa a cada wave. Agora s\u00e3o 40 waves com bosses, b\u00f4nus, vit\u00f3ria e derrota.\n- **WeaponService:** n\u00e3o tinha cooldown nem valida\u00e7\u00e3o, e a origem do tiro era confiada ao cliente. Agora valida tudo e tem headshot.\n- **Controllers de GUI:** s\u00f3 os nomes apareciam nas suas capturas, ent\u00e3o escrevi os seis controllers conforme a hierarquia mostrada.\n- **PlayerRagdoll:** s\u00f3 funcionava em R6 e setava `BreakJointsOnDeath` tarde demais. Corrigido.\n- **Demais ajustes:** o X (demolir) e o F (reparar) n\u00e3o estavam ligados no cliente. Spikes agora usam o `Wear` do Config.\n- **Textos:** todas as strings em portugu\u00eas viraram ingl\u00eas; os coment\u00e1rios com `--` ficaram como estavam.\n\n- **GUI:** os controllers sobrescrevem os textos dos bot\u00f5es, labels e dos dois cabe\u00e7alhos da loja (\"BUILDS\" e \"UPGRADES\"); textos fixos que voc\u00ea deixou nos bot\u00f5es do Studio, e que n\u00e3o aparecem no c\u00f3digo, precisam ser trocados \u00e0 m\u00e3o.\n- **Spawns e mapas:** os zumbis nascem em `ZombieSpawns` (ou `ZombiesSpawns`) dentro do mapa; sem isso usam um c\u00edrculo ao redor da origem. Os mapas ficam em `ServerStorage.Maps`; se a pasta estiver vazia, a vota\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 pulada.\n- **Respawn:** ele agora \u00e9 controlado pelo jogo. Quem morre espera o fim da wave, e se todos morrem a partida reinicia.\n\nArquivos entregues:", "citations": []}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:24:08.353319Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:24:08.621670Z", "flags": null, "type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01LtB6dQVa1CeHMsfmSr5tgN", "name": "present_files", "input": {"filepaths": ["/mnt/user-data/outputs/ZombieWave-Fixed.zip"]}, "message": "Presenting file(s)...", "integration_name": "File Creation", "integration_icon_url": null, "tool_identifier": null, "icon_name": "file", "context": null, "display_content": {"type": "table", "table": [["filepaths", "['/mnt/user-data/outputs/ZombieWave-Fixed.zip']"]]}, "approval_options": null, "approval_key": null, "approval_key_legacy": null, "is_mcp_app": null, "hidden_in_chat": null, "mcp_server_url": null, "tool_origin": "first_party"}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:24:08.650975Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:24:08.651031Z", "flags": null, "type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01LtB6dQVa1CeHMsfmSr5tgN", "name": "present_files", "content": [{"type": "local_resource", "file_path": "/mnt/user-data/outputs/ZombieWave-Fixed.zip", "name": "ZombieWave-Fixed", "mime_type": "application/zip", "artifact_publishable": false}, {"type": "text", "text": "\n\nThe file cards appear with your reply, and where they sit relative to its text depends on the app the user is reading in; finish the reply with text, and refer to a file by its name, never as above or below."}], "is_error": false, "structured_content": null, "meta": {"output_format_category": "other"}, "message": "Presented file", "integration_name": "File Creation", "mcp_server_url": null, "integration_icon_url": null, "icon_name": "file", "display_content": null, "hidden_in_chat": null, "tool_origin": "first_party"}, {"start_ti