ethod: \"GET\",\n            headers: {\n                \"Accept\": \"application/json\"\n            },\n            cf: {\n                cacheEverything: true,\n                // Cacheia s\u00f3 respostas de sucesso; erros (429, 500...) n\u00e3o ficam salvos\n                cacheTtlByStatus: {\n                    \"200-299\": CACHE_TTL,\n                    \"400-599\": 0\n                }\n            }\n        });\n\n        const body = await robloxResponse.text();\n\n        return new Response(body, {\n            status: robloxResponse.status,\n            headers: {\n                \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n                \"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\": \"*\"\n            }\n        });\n    }\n};\n```\n\n## Pr\u00f3ximo passo\n\nPara completar a otimiza\u00e7\u00e3o, falta o lado do servidor (o script que responde ao `GetEmotes` no Roblox). L\u00e1 vale:\n- guardar em cache, por cursor, as p\u00e1ginas j\u00e1 buscadas, assim o segundo jogador n\u00e3o precisa esperar o proxy;\n- pedir ao proxy o maior `limit` que o cat\u00e1logo aceita, para ter menos viagens.\n\nMe mande esse script que eu monto a vers\u00e3o completa tamb\u00e9m.", "citations": []}], "sender": "assistant", "created_at": "2026-10-31T19:12:01.094588Z", "updated_at": "2026-10-31T19:12:01.094588Z", "attachments": [], "files": [], "parent_message_uuid": "01a1935f-533c-7b79-8995-f71ef9856b97"}, {"uuid": "01a1938d-e110-7045-9c4b-dded73bb80da", "text": "remova a parte de dar redacted e fa\u00e7a com que eu consiga usar isso no leaderboard do roblox e me mande ja feito", "content": [{"start_timestamp": "2026-10-31T20:01:54.991941Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-31T20:01:54.991941Z", "flags": null, "type": "text", "text": "remova a parte de dar redacted e fa\u00e7a com que eu consiga usar isso no leaderboard do roblox e me mande ja feito", "citations": []}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-31T20:01:54.991941Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-31T20:01:54.991941Z", "flags": null, "t