xia num GUI customizado (`CoreGui.PlayerListReskin`), que n\u00e3o existe no leaderboard padr\u00e3o. Por isso reescrevi para usar o `PlayerList` padr\u00e3o do Roblox.\n\nPrincipais mudan\u00e7as:\n- **Removi todo o REDACTED** e a op\u00e7\u00e3o `REDACT_INFO`.\n- **Defini as vari\u00e1veis** `FRIEND_COLOR`, `SELF_COLOR` e `SELF_FONT`, que no original nem existiam.\n- **O leaderboard padr\u00e3o n\u00e3o permite editar o menu de contexto**, ent\u00e3o criei um menu pr\u00f3prio. Clique com o **bot\u00e3o direito** num jogador da lista para abrir: copiar UserId, Goto e Espectar.\n- Os nomes s\u00e3o pintados com cor de amigo e cor sua. Eu procuro os elementos por nome, e n\u00e3o por caminho fixo, para n\u00e3o quebrar t\u00e3o f\u00e1cil.\n\n```lua\n--// Leaderboard Mod (leaderboard padr\u00e3o do Roblox)\n--// Cor de amigo / cor pr\u00f3pria + menu com bot\u00e3o direito (UserId, Goto, Espectar)\n\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal CoreGui = game:GetService(\"CoreGui\")\nlocal UserInputService = game:GetService(\"UserInputService\")\n\nlocal LocalPlr = Players.LocalPlayer\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- CONFIGURA\u00c7\u00c3O\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal FRIEND_COLOR = Color3.fromRGB(88, 214, 141)\nlocal SELF_COLOR = Color3.fromRGB(255, 213, 79)\nlocal SELF_FONT = Font.new(\n\t\"rbxasset://fonts/families/GothamSSm.json\",\n\tEnum.FontWeight.Bold\n)\n\nlocal BgColor = Color3.fromRGB(49, 51, 56)\nlocal TextColor = Color3.fromRGB(213, 215, 221)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- LEADERBOARD\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal PlayerListGui = CoreGui:WaitForChild(\"PlayerList\", 10)\n\nif not PlayerListGui then\n\twarn(\"Leaderboard (CoreGui.PlayerList) n\u00e3o encontrado!\")\n\treturn\nend\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- AMIGOS\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal friendCache = {}\n\nlocal function fetchFriend(userId)\n\n\tif userId == LocalPlr.UserId or friendCache[userId] ~= nil then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\ttask.spawn(function()\n\n\t\tlocal ok, result = pcall(function()\n\t\t\treturn LocalPlr:IsFriendsWithAsync(userId)\n\t\tend)\n\n\t\tfriendCache[userId] = ok and result or false\n\n\tend)\n\nend\n\nlocal function desiredColor(userId)\n\n\tif userId == LocalPlr.UserId then\n\t\treturn SELF_COLOR\n\tend\n\n\tif friendCache[userId] then\n\t\treturn FRIEND_COLOR\n\tend\n\n\treturn nil\n\nend\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- MENU (bot\u00e3o direito)\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal menuGui = Instance.new(\"ScreenGui\")\nmenuGui.Name = \"LeaderboardModMenu\"\nmenuGui.ResetOnSpawn = false\nmenuGui.IgnoreGuiInset = true\nmenuGui.DisplayOrder = 1000\nmenuGui.Parent = (gethui and gethui()) or CoreGui\n\nlocal backdrop = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\nbackdrop.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\nbackdrop.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nbackdrop.Text = \"\"\nbackdrop.Visible = false\nbackdrop.ZIndex = 1\nbackdrop.Parent = menuGui\n\nlocal menu = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nmenu.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(210, 0)\nmenu.AutomaticSize = Enum.AutomaticSize.Y\nmenu.BackgroundColor3 = BgColor\nmenu.Visible = false\nmenu.ZIndex = 2\nmenu.Parent = menuGui\n\nlocal menuCorner = Instance.new(\"UICorner\")\nmenuCorner.CornerRadius = UDim.new(0, 8)\nmenuCorner.Parent = menu\n\nlocal menuPadding = Instance.new(\"UIPadding\")\nmenuPadding.PaddingTop = UDim.new(0, 6)\nmenuPadding.PaddingBottom = UDim.new(0, 6)\nmenuPadding.PaddingLeft = UDim.new(0, 6)\nmenuPadding.PaddingRight = UDim.new(0, 6)\nmenuPadding.Parent = menu\n\nlocal menuList = Instance.new(\"UIListLayout\")\nmenuList.SortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder\nmenuList.Padding = UDim.new(0, 2)\nmenuList.Parent = menu\n\nlocal header = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\nheader.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 24)\nheader.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nheader.TextColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255)\nheader.Font = Enum.Font.GothamBold\nheader.TextSize = 14\nheader.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left\nheader.TextTruncate = Enum.TextTruncate.AtEnd\nheader.LayoutOrder = 0\nheader.Parent = menu\n\nlocal function makeButton(order)\n\n\tlocal button = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\n\tbutton.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 28)\n\tbutton.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n\tbutton.TextColor3 = TextColor\n\tbutton.Font = Enum.Font.GothamMedium\n\tbutton.TextSize = 14\n\tbutton.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left\n\tbutton.AutoButtonColor = false\n\tbutton.LayoutOrder = order\n\tbutton.Parent = menu\n\n\tlocal pad = Instance.new(\"UIPadding\")\n\tpad.PaddingLeft = UDim.new(0, 8)\n\tpad.Parent = button\n\n\tbutton.MouseEnter:Connect(function()\n\t\tbutton.TextColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255)\n\tend)\n\n\tbutton.MouseLeave:Connect(function()\n\t\tbutton.TextColor3 = TextColor\n\tend)\n\n\treturn button\n\nend\n\nlocal idButton = makeButton(1)\nlocal gotoButton = makeButton(2)\ngotoButton.Text = \"Goto\"\nlocal specButton = makeButton(3)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- A\u00c7\u00d5ES\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal currentTarget = nil\nlocal spectatingPlr = nil\n\nlocal function hideMenu()\n\tmenu.Visible = false\n\tbackdrop.Visible = false\nend\n\nlocal function stopSpectating()\n\n\tspectatingPlr = nil\n\n\tlocal cam = workspace.CurrentCamera\n\tlocal hum = LocalPlr.Character\n\t\tand LocalPlr.Character:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"Humanoid\")\n\n\tif hum then\n\t\tcam.CameraSubject = hum\n\tend\n\n\tcam.CameraType = Enum.CameraType.Custom\n\nend\n\nlocal function spectate(plr)\n\n\tlocal hum = plr.Character\n\t\tand plr.Character:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"Humanoid\")\n\n\tif not hum then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\tlocal cam = workspace.CurrentCamera\n\n\tspectatingPlr = plr\n\tcam.CameraSubject = hum\n\tcam.CameraType = Enum.CameraType.Custom\n\nend\n\nPlayers.PlayerRemoving:Connect(function(plr)\n\tif plr == spectatingPlr then\n\t\tstopSpectating()\n\tend\nend)\n\nidButton.Activated:Connect(function()\n\n\tif currentTarget and setclipboard then\n\t\tsetclipboard(tostring(currentTarget.UserId))\n\tend\n\n\thideMenu()\n\nend)\n\ngotoButton.Activated:Connect(function()\n\n\tlocal target = currentTarget\n\tlocal myChar = LocalPlr.Character\n\n\tif target and target.Character and myChar then\n\t\tmyChar:PivotTo(target.Character:GetPivot())\n\tend\n\n\thideMenu()\n\nend)\n\nspecButton.Activated:Connect(function()\n\n\tlocal target = currentTarget\n\n\tif target then\n\n\t\tif spectatingPlr == target then\n\t\t\tstopSpectating()\n\t\telse\n\t\t\tspectate(target)\n\t\tend\n\n\tend\n\n\thideMenu()\n\nend)\n\nbackdrop.Activated:Connect(hideMenu)\nbackdrop.MouseButton2Click:Connect(hideMenu)\n\nlocal function showMenu(plr)\n\n\tcurrentTarget = plr\n\n\theader.Text = plr.DisplayName .. \" (@\" .. plr.Name .. \")\"\n\tidButton.Text = \"UserId: \" .. plr.UserId .. \" (copiar)\"\n\tspecButton.Text = (spectatingPlr == plr)\n\t\tand \"Parar de espectar\"\n\t\tor \"Espectar\"\n\n\tlocal mouse = UserInputService:GetMouseLocation()\n\tlocal viewport = workspace.CurrentCamera.ViewportSize\n\n\tmenu.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(\n\t\tmath.min(mouse.X, viewport.X - 220),\n\t\tmath.min(mouse.Y, viewport.Y - 150)\n\t)\n\n\tbackdrop.Visible = true\n\tmenu.Visible = true\n\nend\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- HOVER + BOT\u00c3O DIREITO\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal hoveredPlayer = nil\n\nUserInputService.InputBegan:Connect(function(input)\n\n\tif input.UserInputType == Enum.UserInputType.MouseButton2\n\t\tand hoveredPlayer\n\tthen\n\t\tshowMenu(hoveredPlayer)\n\tend\n\nend)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- ESTILIZA AS LINHAS DO LEADERBOARD\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal styled = setmetatable({}, { __mode = \"k\" })\n\nlocal function findNameLabel(row, plr)\n\n\t-- 1\u00aa tentativa: label chamado \"PlayerName\"\n\tfor _, d in ipairs(row:GetDescendants()) do\n\t\tif d:IsA(\"TextLabel\") and d.Name == \"PlayerName\" then\n\t\t\treturn d\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\t-- 2\u00aa tentativa: label cujo texto \u00e9 o nome do jogador\n\tfor _, d in ipairs(row:GetDescendants()) do\n\t\tif d:IsA(\"TextLabel\")\n\t\t\tand (d.Text == plr.DisplayName or d.Text == plr.Name)\n\t\tthen\n\t\t\treturn d\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\treturn nil\n\nend\n\nlocal function styleRow(row)\n\n\tif styled[row] then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\tstyled[row] = true\n\n\tlocal userId = tonumber(row.Name:match(\"^p_(%d+)$\"))\n\n\tif not userId then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\tlocal plr = Players:GetPlayerByUserId(userId)\n\n\tif not plr then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\t-- Hover (usado pelo menu de bot\u00e3o direito)\n\trow.MouseEnter:Connect(function()\n\t\thoveredPlayer = plr\n\tend)\n\n\trow.MouseLeave:Connect(function()\n\t\tif hoveredPlayer == plr then\n\t\t\thoveredPlayer = nil\n\t\tend\n\tend)\n\n\tfetchFriend(userId)\n\n\t-- Espera a linha terminar de ser montada\n\tlocal label\n\n\tfor _ = 1, 30 do\n\n\t\tlabel = findNameLabel(row, plr)\n\n\t\tif label then\n\t\t\tbreak\n\t\tend\n\n\t\ttask.wait(0.1)\n\n\tend\n\n\tif not label then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\tlocal function paint()\n\n\t\tlocal color = desiredColor(userId)\n\n\t\tif color and label.TextColor3 ~= color then\n\t\t\tlabel.TextColor3 = color\n\t\tend\n\n\t\tif userId == LocalPlr.UserId and label.FontFace ~= SELF_FONT then\n\t\t\tlabel.FontFace = SELF_FONT\n\t\tend\n\n\tend\n\n\tpaint()\n\n\t-- Se o Roblox redesenhar a linha e resetar a cor, pinta de novo\n\tlabel:GetPropertyChangedSignal(\"TextColor3\"):Connect(paint)\n\tlabel:GetPropertyChangedSignal(\"FontFace\"):Connect(paint)\n\n\t-- Quando a checagem de amizade terminar, repinta\n\ttask.spawn(function()\n\n\t\tfor _ = 1, 50 do\n\n\t\t\tif friendCache[userId] ~= nil then\n\t\t\t\tpaint()\n\t\t\t\treturn\n\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\ttask.wait(0.1)\n\n\t\tend\n\n\tend)\n\nend\n\nlocal function scan(inst)\n\n\tif inst:IsA(\"GuiObject\") and inst.Name:match(\"^p_%d+$\") then\n\t\ttask.spawn(styleRow, inst)\n\tend\n\nend\n\nfor _, d in ipairs(PlayerListGui:GetDescendants()) do\n\tscan(d)\nend\n\nPlayerListGui.DescendantAdded:Connect(scan)\n```\n\nDuas observa\u00e7\u00f5es:\n1. Eu n\u00e3o consigo testar no Roblox, e a estrutura interna do leaderboard muda com atualiza\u00e7\u00f5es. Se as cores n\u00e3o aparecerem ou o bot\u00e3o direito n\u00e3o abrir o menu, me diga o que acontece (ou me mande a hierarquia de `CoreGui.PlayerList` do Explorer) que eu ajusto.\n2. Para mudar as cores, edite `FRIEND_COLOR` e `SELF_COLOR` no topo do script.", "content": [{"start_timestamp": "2026-10-31T20:01:55.376069Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-31T20:02:54.997966Z", "flags": null, "type": "thinking", "thinking": "", "summaries": [{"summary": "Reviewing a script for Roblox exploit features."}, {"summary": "Weighing whether the script breaks Roblox rules."}, {"summary": "Reconsidering how to rewrite the script for the default leaderboard."}, {"summary": "Planning a robust leaderboard row lookup without hardcoded paths."}, {"summary": "Choosing how to add a right-click menu to leaderboard rows."}, {"summary": "Checking how to query friend status safely."}, {"summary": "Wiring up row styling and the right-click menu."}, {"summary": "Building the right-click menu's layout and actions."}, {"summary": "Choosing how to detect which leaderboard row was right-clicked."}, {"summary": "Confirming right-click handling on rows."}, {"summary": "Ajustando o menu de espectador e o fechamento ao clicar fora."}], "cut_off": false, "truncated": true, "hidden": false, "thinking_hidden": true, "alternative_display_type": null, "signature": null}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-31T20:02:54.998030Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-31T20:03:17.724109Z", "flags": null, "type": "text", "text": "Prontinho. O script original mexia num GUI customizado (`CoreGui.PlayerListReskin`), que n\u00e3o existe no leaderboard padr\u0