muito grande.\n\n## Poss\u00edveis causas dos likes\n1. **Teste com um jogador s\u00f3.** N\u00e3o d\u00e1 para curtir a si mesmo, e o bot\u00e3o nem aparece no seu pr\u00f3prio menu. Teste em **Test > Clients and Servers** com 2 jogadores.\n2. **DataStore desligado no Studio.** Ative em **Game Settings > Security > Enable Studio Access to API Services**. Sem isso, toda leitura e grava\u00e7\u00e3o falha.\n3. **Script de servidor no lugar errado.** Ele precisa ser um **Script** (n\u00e3o LocalScript) dentro de **ServerScriptService**. Se ele n\u00e3o rodar, o bot\u00e3o \"\ud83d\udc4dLike\" nem aparece.\n\nAgora, ao clicar em Like, o bot\u00e3o mostra o que aconteceu: `\ud83d\udc4d...` enquanto envia, `\ud83d\udc4dLiked` se deu certo, `\ud83d\udc4dErro` se falhou, `\ud83d\udc4dAguarde` se clicou r\u00e1pido demais.\n\n---\n\n## 1) Script de servidor (substitua o `PlayerLikes`)\n\n```lua\n--// PlayerLikes\n--// Script em ServerScriptService\n\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal DataStoreService = game:GetService(\"DataStoreService\")\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\n\nlocal store = DataStoreService:GetDataStore(\"PlayerLikes_v1\")\n\nlocal LIKE_COOLDOWN = 1 -- segundos entre likes do mesmo jogador\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- REMOTES\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal folder = Instance.new(\"Folder\")\nfolder.Name = \"PlayerLikes\"\nfolder.Parent = ReplicatedStorage\n\nlocal LikePlayer = Instance.new(\"RemoteFunction\")\nLikePlayer.Name = \"LikePlayer\"\nLikePlayer.Parent = folder\n\nlocal HasLiked = Instance.new(\"RemoteFunction\")\nHasLiked.Name = \"HasLiked\"\nHasLiked.Parent = folder\n\nprint(\"[PlayerLikes] Servidor de likes iniciado\")\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- UTILIDADES\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function retry(label, fn, tries)\n\ttries = tries or 3\n\n\tlocal lastError\n\n\tfor i = 1, tries do\n\t\tlocal ok, result = pcall(fn)\n\n\t\tif ok then\n\t\t\treturn true, result\n\t\tend\n\n\t\tlastError = result\n\t\ttask.wait(i)\n\tend\n\n\twarn(\"[PlayerLikes] DataStore falhou em '\" .. label .. \"':\", lastError)\n\n\treturn false, nil\nend\n\nlocal given = {}     -- given[player] = {[targetUserId] = true}\nlocal busy = {}      -- busy[player] = true enquanto processa\nlocal lastLike = {}  -- lastLike[player] = os.clock()\n\nlocal function ensureGiven(player)\n\tif given[player] then\n\t\treturn given[player]\n\tend\n\n\tlocal ok, list = retry(\"ler Given\", function()\n\t\treturn store:GetAsync(\"Given_\" .. player.UserId)\n\tend)\n\n\tif not ok then\n\t\treturn nil\n\tend\n\n\tlocal set = {}\n\n\tif type(list) == \"table\" then\n\t\tfor _, id in ipairs(list) do\n\t\t\tset[id] = true\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\tgiven[player] = set\n\n\treturn set\nend\n\nlocal function getStatsFolder(player)\n\tlocal stats = player:FindFirstChild(\"leaderstats\")\n\n\tif stats then\n\t\treturn stats\n\tend\n\n\t-- Espera o m\u00f3dulo Leaderstats criar\n\tstats = player:WaitForChild(\"leaderstats\", 5)\n\n\tif stats then\n\t\treturn stats\n\tend\n\n\tstats = Instance.new(\"Folder\")\n\tstats.Name = \"leaderstats\"\n\tstats.Parent = player\n\n\treturn stats\nend\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- JOGADOR ENTRA\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function onPlayerAdded(player)\n\tlocal stats = getStatsFolder(player)\n\n\tlocal likes = stats:FindFirstChild(\"Likes\")\n\n\tif not likes then\n\t\tlikes = Instance.new(\"IntValue\")\n\t\tlikes.Name = \"Likes\"\n\t\tlikes.Value = 0\n\t\tlikes.Parent = stats\n\tend\n\n\tlocal ok, received = retry(\"ler Received\", function()\n\t\treturn store:GetAsync(\"Received_\" .. player.UserId)\n\tend)\n\n\tif ok and type(received) == \"number\" then\n\t\tlikes.Value = received\n\tend\n\n\tensureGiven(player)\nend\n\nfor _, player in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do\n\ttask.spawn(onPlayerAdded, player)\nend\n\nPlayers.PlayerAdded:Connect(onPlayerAdded)\n\nPlayers.PlayerRemoving:Connect(function(player)\n\tgiven[player] = nil\n\tbusy[player] = nil\n\tlastLike[player] = nil\nend)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- DAR LIKE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nLikePlayer.OnServerInvoke = function(player, targetUserId)\n\tif type(targetUserId) ~= \"number\" then\n\t\treturn \"invalid\"\n\tend\n\n\tlocal target = Players:GetPlayerByUserId(targetUserId)\n\n\tif not target or target == player then\n\t\treturn \"invalid\"\n\tend\n\n\tif busy[player] then\n\t\treturn \"busy\"\n\tend\n\n\tif lastLike[player] and os.clock() - lastLike[player] < LIKE_COOLDOWN then\n\t\treturn \"busy\"\n\tend\n\n\tbusy[player] = true\n\tlastLike[player] = os.clock()\n\n\tlocal result = \"error\"\n\n\tlocal success, err = pcall(function()\n\n\t\tlocal set = ensureGiven(player)\n\n\t\tif not set then\n\t\t\twarn(\"[PlayerLikes] N\u00e3o foi poss\u00edvel ler os likes de \" .. player.Name\n\t\t\t\t.. \". Em Studio, ative 'Enable Studio Access to API Services'.\")\n\t\t\tresult = \"error\"\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tend\n\n\t\tif set[targetUserId] then\n\t\t\tresult = \"already\"\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tend\n\n\t\t-- Soma +1 no total do jogador curtido (at\u00f4mico)\n\t\tlocal ok, newTotal = retry(\"somar Received\", function()\n\t\t\treturn store:UpdateAsync(\"Received_\" .. targetUserId, function(old)\n\t\t\t\treturn (tonumber(old) or 0) + 1\n\t\t\tend)\n\t\tend)\n\n\t\tif not ok then\n\t\t\tresult = \"error\"\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tend\n\n\t\tset[targetUserId] = true\n\n\t\t-- Registra que este jogador j\u00e1 curtiu esse alvo\n\t\tretry(\"gravar Given\", function()\n\t\t\treturn store:UpdateAsync(\"Given_\" .. player.UserId, function(old)\n\t\t\t\told = type(old) == \"table\" and old or {}\n\n\t\t\t\tif not table.find(old, targetUserId) then\n\t\t\t\t\ttable.insert(old, targetUserId)\n\t\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t\treturn old\n\t\t\tend)\n\t\tend)\n\n\t\t-- Atualiza o valor que aparece na playerlist\n\t\tlocal stats = target:FindFirstChild(\"leaderstats\")\n\t\tlocal likes = stats and stats:FindFirstChild(\"Likes\")\n\n\t\tif likes and type(newTotal) == \"number\" then\n\t\t\tlikes.Value = newTotal\n\t\tend\n\n\t\tresult = \"ok\"\n\tend)\n\n\tbusy[player] = nil\n\n\tif not success then\n\t\twarn(\"[PlayerLikes] Erro inesperado:\", err)\n\t\treturn \"error\"\n\tend\n\n\treturn result\nend\n\nHasLiked.OnServerInvoke = function(player, targetUserId)\n\tif type(targetUserId) ~= \"number\" then\n\t\treturn false\n\tend\n\n\tlocal set = ensureGiven(player)\n\n\treturn set ~= nil and set[targetUserId] == true\nend\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2) LocalScript da playerlist (substitua o conte\u00fado inteiro)\n\n```lua\n--// PlayerList Reskin\n--// LocalScript em StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts\n\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal StarterGui = game:GetService(\"StarterGui\")\nlocal RunService = game:GetService(\"RunService\")\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\nlocal UserInputService = game:GetService(\"UserInputService\")\n\nlocal LocalPlr = Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal PlayerGui = LocalPlr:WaitForChild(\"PlayerGui\")\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- CONFIGURA\u00c7\u00c3O\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal BgColor = Color3.fromRGB(49, 51, 56)\nlocal TEXT_COLOR = Color3.fromRGB(213, 215, 221)\nlocal WHITE = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255)\nlocal FRIEND_COLOR = Color3.fromRGB(88, 214, 141)\nlocal SELF_COLOR = Color3.fromRGB(255, 213, 79)\n\nlocal VIEW_COLOR = Color3.fromRGB(74, 55, 106)\nlocal VIEW_HOVER_COLOR = Color3.fromRGB(130, 100, 185)\n\nlocal NORMAL_FONT = Font.new(\"rbxasset://fonts/families/GothamSSm.json\", Enum.FontWeight.Medium)\nlocal SELF_FONT = Font.new(\"rbxasset://fonts/families/GothamSSm.json\", Enum.FontWeight.Bold)\n\nlocal ROW_HEIGHT = 28\nlocal PANEL_BASE_WIDTH = 196\nlocal STAT_WIDTH = 84\n\nlocal HEADER_HEIGHT = 44  -- espa\u00e7o do t\u00edtulo\nlocal FOOTER_HEIGHT = 8   -- margem de baixo\n\n-- Stats do leaderstats que voc\u00ea N\u00c3O quer mostrar. Ex: {Coins = true}\nlocal HIDDEN_STATS = {}\n\n-- Ordem das colunas (as que n\u00e3o est\u00e3o aqui v\u00e3o depois)\nlocal STAT_ORDER = { \"Spent\", \"Likes\" }\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- REMOTES DE LIKE (criados pelo script PlayerLikes no servidor)\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal LikePlayer, HasLiked\n\ntask.spawn(function()\n    local folder = ReplicatedStorage:WaitForChild(\"PlayerLikes\", 15)\n\n    if not folder then\n        warn(\"[Playerlist] Remotes de like n\u00e3o encontrados. O script PlayerLikes est\u00e1 em ServerScriptService (como Script)?\")\n        return\n    end\n\n    LikePlayer = folder:WaitForChild(\"LikePlayer\", 5)\n    HasLiked = folder:WaitForChild(\"HasLiked\", 5)\nend)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- DESATIVA O LEADERBOARD PADR\u00c3O\n--------------------------------------------------\n\ntask.spawn(function()\n    for _ = 1, 10 do\n        local ok = pcall(function()\n            StarterGui:SetCoreGuiEnabled(Enum.CoreGuiType.PlayerList, false)\n        end)\n        if ok then break end\n        task.wait(0.5)\n    end\nend)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- FUN\u00c7\u00d5ES AUXILIARES\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function addShadow(parent)\n    -- Se a sua vers\u00e3o do Studio n\u00e3o tiver UIShadow, simplesmente ignora\n    pcall(function()\n        local shadow = Instance.new(\"UIShadow\")\n        shadow.Transparency = 0.5\n        shadow.BlurRadius = UDim.new(0, 10)\n        shadow.Parent = parent\n    end)\nend\n\nlocal function addCorner(parent, radius)\n    local corner = Instance.new(\"UICorner\")\n    corner.CornerRadius = UDim.new(0, radius)\n    corner.Parent = parent\nend\n\nlocal friendCache = {}\n\nlocal function checkFriend(userId, fresh)\n    if userId == LocalPlr.UserId then\n        return false\n    end\n\n    if not fresh and friendCache[userId] ~= nil then\n        return friendCache[userId]\n    end\n\n    local ok, result = pcall(function()\n        return LocalPlr:IsFriendsWithAsync(userId)\n    end)\n\n    friendCache[userId] = ok and result == true\n    return friendCache[userId]\nend\n\nlocal function makeLabel(parent, name, text, size, order, font)\n    local label = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\n    label.Name = name\n    label.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    label.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, size + 4)\n    label.Text = text\n    label.TextColor3 = WHITE\n    label.FontFace = font or NORMAL_FONT\n    label.TextSize = size\n    label.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left\n    label.TextTruncate = Enum.TextTruncate.AtEnd\n    label.LayoutOrder = order\n    label.Parent = parent\n    return label\nend\n\nlocal function formatValue(value)\n    if type(value) == \"number\" then\n        local int = math.floor(value)\n\n        if int == value then\n            local sign = int < 0 and \"-\" or \"\"\n            local s = tostring(math.abs(int))\n            local formatted = s:reverse():gsub(\"(%d%d%d)\", \"%1,\"):reverse()\n            formatted = formatted:gsub(\"^,\", \"\")\n            return sign .. formatted\n        end\n\n        return tostring(math.floor(value * 100) / 100)\n    end\n\n    return tostring(value)\nend\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- CRIA O GUI\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal GUI = Instance.new(\"ScreenGui\")\nGUI.Name = \"PlayerListReskin\"\nGUI.ResetOnSpawn = false\nGUI.IgnoreGuiInset = true\nGUI.DisplayOrder = 10\nGUI.Parent = PlayerGui\n\nlocal Container = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nContainer.Name = \"Container\"\nContainer.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\nContainer.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nContainer.Parent = GUI\n\nlocal Panel = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nPanel.Name = \"PlayerListPanel\"\nPanel.AnchorPoint = Vector2.new(1, 0)\nPanel.Position = UDim2.new(1, -10, 0, 50)\nPanel.Size = UDim2.new(0, PANEL_BASE_WIDTH, 0, HEADER_HEIGHT + ROW_HEIGHT + FOOTER_HEIGHT)\nPanel.BackgroundColor3 = BgColor\nPanel.BackgroundTransparency = 0.1\nPanel.BorderSizePixel = 0\nPanel.Parent = Container\naddCorner(Panel, 8)\n\nlocal LeaderboardBody = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nLeaderboardBody.Name = \"LeaderboardBody\"\nLeaderboardBody.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\nLeaderboardBody.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nLeaderboardBody.Parent = Panel\n\nlocal Title = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\nTitle.Name = \"Title\"\nTitle.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(12, 8)\nTitle.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(80, 28)\nTitle.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nTitle.Text = \"Players\"\nTitle.TextColor3 = WHITE\nTitle.FontFace = SELF_FONT\nTitle.TextSize = 16\nTitle.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left\nTitle.Parent = LeaderboardBody\n\n-- Cabe\u00e7alho das colunas de stats (Spent, Likes, etc.)\nlocal StatsHeader = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nStatsHeader.Name = \"StatsHeader\"\nStatsHeader.AnchorPoint = Vector2.new(1, 0)\nStatsHeader.Position = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 8)\nStatsHeader.Size = UDim2.new(0, 0, 0, 28)\nStatsHeader.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nStatsHeader.Parent = LeaderboardBody\n\nlocal headerList = Instance.new(\"UIListLayout\")\nheaderList.FillDirection = Enum.FillDirection.Horizontal\nheaderList.SortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder\nheaderList.Parent = StatsHeader\n\nlocal PlayerRows = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nPlayerRows.Name = \"PlayerRows\"\nPlayerRows.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(0, HEADER_HEIGHT)\nPlayerRows.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 1, -(HEADER_HEIGHT + FOOTER_HEIGHT))\nPlayerRows.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nPlayerRows.Parent = LeaderboardBody\n\nlocal PlayersContainer = Instance.new(\"ScrollingFrame\")\nPlayersContainer.Name = \"ScrollingFrame\"\nPlayersContainer.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\nPlayersContainer.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nPlayersContainer.BorderSizePixel = 0\nPlayersContainer.ScrollBarThickness = 3\nPlayersContainer.CanvasSize = UDim2.new()\nPlayersContainer.AutomaticCanvasSize = Enum.AutomaticSize.Y\nPlayersContainer.Parent = PlayerRows\n\n-- \"Time\" \u00fanico que cont\u00e9m todas as linhas\nlocal TeamFrame = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nTeamFrame.Name = \"Players\"\nTeamFrame.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 0)\nTeamFrame.AutomaticSize = Enum.AutomaticSize.Y\nTeamFrame.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nTeamFrame.Parent = PlayersContainer\n\nlocal TeamList = Instance.new(\"UIListLayout\")\nTeamList.SortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder\nTeamList.Parent = TeamFrame\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- ESTADO COMPARTILHADO\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal updatePanel -- definida logo abaixo\n\nlocal statNames = {}    -- ordem das colunas\nlocal statIndex = {}    -- statIndex[nome] = posi\u00e7\u00e3o\nlocal headerLabels = {} -- headerLabels[nome] = TextLabel\nlocal rowRefs = {}      -- rowRefs[player] = {row, nameText, statsFrame, labels, destroyed}\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- TAMANHO DO PAINEL (acompanha a quantidade real de linhas)\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function statsWidth()\n    return #statNames * STAT_WIDTH\nend\n\nupdatePanel = function()\n    local content = TeamList.AbsoluteContentSize.Y\n\n    local camera = workspace.CurrentCamera\n    local viewportHeight = camera and camera.ViewportSize.Y or 720\n    local maxHeight = math.max(120, viewportHeight - 120)\n\n    local height = math.min(HEADER_HEIGHT + content + FOOTER_HEIGHT, maxHeight)\n\n    Panel.Size = UDim2.new(0, PANEL_BASE_WIDTH + statsWidth(), 0, height)\nend\n\nTeamList:GetPropertyChangedSignal(\"AbsoluteContentSize\"):Connect(updatePanel)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- COLUNAS DE STATS (leaderstats)\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function applyRowLayout(ref)\n    local width = statsWidth()\n    ref.statsFrame.Size = UDim2.new(0, width, 1, 0)\n    ref.nameText.Size = UDim2.new(1, -(18 + width), 1, 0)\nend\n\nlocal function createStatLabel(parent, name, text, textSize)\n    local label = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\n    label.Name = name\n    label.Size = UDim2.new(0, STAT_WIDTH, 1, 0)\n    label.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    label.Text = text\n    label.TextColor3 = TEXT_COLOR\n    label.FontFace = NORMAL_FONT\n    label.TextSize = textSize\n    label.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Right\n    label.TextTruncate = Enum.TextTruncate.AtEnd\n    label.LayoutOrder = statIndex[name]\n    label.Parent = parent\n\n    local pad = Instance.new(\"UIPadding\")\n    pad.PaddingRight = UDim.new(0, 8)\n    pad.Parent = label\n\n    return label\nend\n\nlocal function getStatLabel(ref, name)\n    local label = ref.labels[name]\n\n    if label then\n        return label\n    end\n\n    label = createStatLabel(ref.statsFrame, name, \"-\", 13)\n    ref.labels[name] = label\n\n    return label\nend\n\nlocal function statPriority(name)\n    for i, v in ipairs(STAT_ORDER) do\n        if v == name then\n            return i\n        end\n    end\n\n    return #STAT_ORDER + 1\nend\n\nlocal function reindexStats()\n    local seq = {}\n\n    for i, name in ipairs(statNames) do\n        seq[name] = i\n    end\n\n    table.sort(statNames, function(a, b)\n        local pa, pb = statPriority(a), statPriority(b)\n\n        if pa ~= pb then\n            return pa < pb\n        end\n\n        return seq[a] < seq[b]\n    end)\n\n    for i, name in ipairs(statNames) do\n        statIndex[name] = i\n\n        if headerLabels[name] then\n            headerLabels[name].LayoutOrder = i\n        end\n\n        for _, ref in pairs(rowRefs) do\n            local label = ref.labels[name]\n\n            if label then\n                label.LayoutOrder = i\n            end\n        end\n    end\nend\n\nlocal function refreshStatsLayout()\n    for _, ref in pairs(rowRefs) do\n        applyRowLayout(ref)\n    end\n\n    StatsHeader.Size = UDim2.new(0, statsWidth(), 0, 28)\n\n    updatePanel()\nend\n\nlocal function registerStat(name)\n    if HIDDEN_STATS[name] or statIndex[name] then\n        return\n    end\n\n    table.insert(statNames, name)\n    statIndex[name] = #statNames\n\n    headerLabels[name] = createStatLabel(StatsHeader, name, name, 12)\n\n    for _, ref in pairs(rowRefs) do\n        getStatLabel(ref, name)\n    end\n\n    reindexStats()\n    refreshStatsLayout()\nend\n\nlocal function bindValue(ref, valueObj)\n    if not valueObj:IsA(\"ValueBase\") then\n        return\n    end\n\n    local name = valueObj.Name\n\n    if HIDDEN_STATS[name] then\n        return\n    end\n\n    registerStat(name)\n\n    local label = getStatLabel(ref, name)\n\n    local function update()\n        label.Text = formatValue(valueObj.Value)\n    end\n\n    update()\n\n    valueObj:GetPropertyChangedSignal(\"Value\"):Connect(update)\nend\n\nlocal function trackPlayer(plr, ref)\n    task.spawn(function()\n        local stats = plr:WaitForChild(\"leaderstats\", 30)\n\n        if not stats or ref.destroyed then\n            return\n        end\n\n        for _, v in ipairs(stats:GetChildren()) do\n            bindValue(ref, v)\n        end\n\n        stats.ChildAdded:Connect(function(v)\n            if not ref.destroyed then\n                bindValue(ref, v)\n            end\n        end)\n    end)\nend\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- CORES (amigo / voc\u00ea) - sem travar o script\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function styleRow(row)\n    local userId = tonumber(row.Name:match(\"^Player_(%d+)$\"))\n\n    if not userId then\n        return\n    end\n\n    local nameText = row:FindFirstChild(\"NameText\", true)\n\n    if not nameText then\n        return\n    end\n\n    if userId == LocalPlr.UserId then\n        nameText.TextColor3 = SELF_COLOR\n        nameText.FontFace = SELF_FONT\n        return\n    end\n\n    -- A checagem de amizade roda em segundo plano\n    task.spawn(function()\n        local isFriend = checkFriend(userId)\n\n        if isFriend and nameText.Parent then\n            nameText.TextColor3 = FRIEND_COLOR\n        end\n    end)\nend\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- CRIA AS LINHAS\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal rowCount = 0\nlocal openContextMenu -- definido mais abaixo\n\nlocal function createRow(plr)\n    -- Evita linha duplicada\n    if rowRefs[plr] then\n        return rowRefs[plr].row\n    end\n\n    rowCount += 1\n\n    local row = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    row.Name = \"Player_\" .. plr.UserId\n    row.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, ROW_HEIGHT)\n    row.BackgroundColor3 = WHITE\n    row.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    row.LayoutOrder = rowCount\n    addCorner(row, 5)\n\n    local content = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    content.Name = \"RowContent\"\n    content.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\n    content.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    content.Parent = row\n\n    local cell = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    cell.Name = \"PeopleCell\"\n    cell.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\n    cell.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    cell.Parent = content\n\n    local nameText = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\n    nameText.Name = \"NameText\"\n    nameText.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(12, 0)\n    nameText.Size = UDim2.new(1, -20, 1, 0)\n    nameText.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    nameText.Text = plr.DisplayName\n    nameText.TextColor3 = TEXT_COLOR\n    nameText.FontFace = NORMAL_FONT\n    nameText.TextSize = 14\n    nameText.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left\n    nameText.TextTruncate = Enum.TextTruncate.AtEnd\n    nameText.Parent = cell\n\n    -- Colunas de stats (\u00e0 direita)\n    local statsFrame = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    statsFrame.Name = \"Stats\"\n    statsFrame.AnchorPoint = Vector2.new(1, 0)\n    statsFrame.Position = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0)\n    statsFrame.Size = UDim2.new(0, 0, 1, 0)\n    statsFrame.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    statsFrame.Parent = cell\n\n    local statsList = Instance.new(\"UIListLayout\")\n    statsList.FillDirection = Enum.FillDirection.Horizontal\n    statsList.SortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder\n    statsList.Parent = statsFrame\n\n    local hitbox = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\n    hitbox.Name = \"Hitbox\"\n    hitbox.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\n    hitbox.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    hitbox.Text = \"\"\n    hitbox.ZIndex = 2\n    hitbox.Parent = cell\n\n    hitbox.MouseEnter:Connect(function() row.BackgroundTransparency = 0.9 end)\n    hitbox.MouseLeave:Connect(function() row.BackgroundTransparency = 1 end)\n    hitbox.Activated:Connect(function() openContextMenu(plr) end)\n    hitbox.MouseButton2Click:Connect(function() openContextMenu(plr) end)\n\n    local ref = {\n        row = row,\n        nameText = nameText,\n        statsFrame = statsFrame,\n        labels = {},\n        destroyed = false,\n    }\n\n    rowRefs[plr] = ref\n\n    for _, name in ipairs(statNames) do\n        getStatLabel(ref, name)\n    end\n\n    applyRowLayout(ref)\n    styleRow(row)\n\n    row.Parent = TeamFrame\n\n    trackPlayer(plr, ref)\n\n    return row\nend\n\nlocal function removeRow(plr)\n    local ref = rowRefs[plr]\n\n    if ref then\n        ref.destroyed = true\n        rowRefs[plr] = nil\n        ref.row:Destroy()\n    end\nend\n\n-- Conecta os eventos ANTES de criar as linhas (ningu\u00e9m fica de fora)\nPlayers.PlayerAdded:Connect(createRow)\nPlayers.PlayerRemoving:Connect(removeRow)\n\nfor _, plr in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do\n    createRow(plr)\nend\n\nupdatePanel()\naddShadow(Panel)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- VISUALIZADOR DE AVATAR (\"View\")\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal viewerConn\n\nlocal function closeViewer()\n    if viewerConn then\n        viewerConn:Disconnect()\n        viewerConn = nil\n    end\n\n    local old = GUI:FindFirstChild(\"AvatarViewer\")\n\n    if old then\n        old:Destroy()\n    end\nend\n\nlocal function buildAvatarModel(plr)\n    -- 1\u00aa op\u00e7\u00e3o: clona o personagem que est\u00e1 no jogo (o que ele est\u00e1 usando agora)\n    local char = plr.Character\n\n    if char then\n        local ok, clone = pcall(function()\n            char.Archivable = true\n            return char:Clone()\n        end)\n\n        if ok and clone then\n            for _, d in ipairs(clone:GetDescendants()) do\n                if d:IsA(\"BaseScript\") or d:IsA(\"Sound\") then\n                    d:Destroy()\n                end\n            end\n\n            return clone\n        end\n    end\n\n    -- 2\u00aa op\u00e7\u00e3o: monta o avatar a partir do perfil do jogador\n    local ok, model = pcall(function()\n        return Players:CreateHumanoidModelFromUserId(plr.UserId)\n    end)\n\n    if ok and model then\n        return model\n    end\n\n    return nil\nend\n\nlocal function openViewer(plr)\n    closeViewer()\n\n    local model = buildAvatarModel(plr)\n\n    if not model then\n        warn(\"N\u00e3o foi poss\u00edvel carregar o avatar de \" .. plr.Name)\n        return\n    end\n\n    local backdrop = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\n    backdrop.Name = \"AvatarViewer\"\n    backdrop.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\n    backdrop.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.new(0, 0, 0)\n    backdrop.BackgroundTransparency = 0.5\n    backdrop.Text = \"\"\n    backdrop.AutoButtonColor = false\n    backdrop.ZIndex = 20\n    backdrop.Activated:Connect(closeViewer)\n    backdrop.Parent = GUI\n\n    local window = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    window.Name = \"Window\"\n    window.AnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5)\n    window.Position = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 0.5)\n    window.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(320, 440)\n    window.BackgroundColor3 = BgColor\n    window.Active = true\n    window.ZIndex = 21\n    window.Parent = backdrop\n    addCorner(window, 10)\n    addShadow(window)\n\n    local title = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\n    title.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(14, 10)\n    title.Size = UDim2.new(1, -60, 0, 28)\n    title.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    title.Text = plr.DisplayName .. \" (@\" .. plr.Name .. \")\"\n    title.TextColor3 = WHITE\n    title.FontFace = SELF_FONT\n    title.TextSize = 16\n    title.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left\n    title.TextTruncate = Enum.TextTruncate.AtEnd\n    title.Parent = window\n\n    local close = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\n    close.AnchorPoint = Vector2.new(1, 0)\n    close.Position = UDim2.new(1, -10, 0, 10)\n    close.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(28, 28)\n    close.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    close.Text = \"\u2715\"\n    close.TextColor3 = TEXT_COLOR\n    close.TextSize = 16\n    close.Font = Enum.Font.GothamBold\n    close.Parent = window\n    close.Activated:Connect(closeViewer)\n\n    local viewport = Instance.new(\"ViewportFrame\")\n    viewport.Name = \"Viewport\"\n    viewport.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(12, 48)\n    viewport.Size = UDim2.new(1, -24, 1, -60)\n    viewport.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(35, 37, 41)\n    viewport.BorderSizePixel = 0\n    viewport.Ambient = Color3.fromRGB(190, 190, 190)\n    viewport.LightColor = WHITE\n    viewport.Parent = window\n    addCorner(viewport, 8)\n\n    local cam = Instance.new(\"Camera\")\n    cam.FieldOfView = 40\n    cam.Parent = viewport\n    viewport.CurrentCamera = cam\n\n    model.Parent = viewport\n\n    local cf, size = model:GetBoundingBox()\n    local halfFov = math.rad(cam.FieldOfView / 2)\n    local distance = (size.Y / 2) / math.tan(halfFov) * 1.15 + size.Z / 2\n\n    cam.CFrame = CFrame.lookAt(cf.Position + cf.LookVector * distance, cf.Position)\n\n    -- Gira o avatar devagar\n    viewerConn = RunService.RenderStepped:Connect(function(dt)\n        if model.Parent then\n            model:PivotTo(model:GetPivot() * CFrame.Angles(0, dt * 0.8, 0))\n        end\n    end)\nend\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- MENU DE CONTEXTO (criado ao clicar num jogador)\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function makeAction(menu, name, order, icon, text, callback, baseColor, hoverColor)\n    baseColor = baseColor or TEXT_COLOR\n    hoverColor = hoverColor or WHITE\n\n    local button = Instance.new(\"ImageButton\")\n    button.Name = name\n    button.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 30)\n    button.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    button.Image = \"\"\n    button.AutoButtonColor = false\n    button.LayoutOrder = order\n    button:SetAttribute(\"BaseColor\", baseColor)\n    button:SetAttribute(\"HoverColor\", hoverColor)\n    button.Parent = menu\n\n    local iconLabel = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\n    iconLabel.Name = \"Icon\"\n    iconLabel.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(6, 0)\n    iconLabel.Size = UDim2.new(0, 24, 1, 0)\n    iconLabel.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    iconLabel.Text = icon\n    iconLabel.TextColor3 = baseColor\n    iconLabel.TextSize = 16\n    iconLabel.Font = Enum.Font.GothamMedium\n    iconLabel.Parent = button\n\n    local label = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\n    label.Name = \"Label\"\n    label.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(36, 0)\n    label.Size = UDim2.new(1, -40, 1, 0)\n    label.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    label.Text = text\n    label.TextColor3 = baseColor\n    label.FontFace = NORMAL_FONT\n    label.TextSize = 14\n    label.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left\n    label.Parent = button\n\n    button.Activated:Connect(callback)\n\n    return button\nend\n\nfunction openContextMenu(plr)\n    local isSelf = plr == LocalPlr\n    local friend = false\n\n    if not isSelf then\n        friend = checkFriend(plr.UserId, true)\n    end\n\n    if not plr.Parent then\n        return\n    end\n\n    local old = GUI:FindFirstChild(\"ContextMenu\")\n    if old then old:Destroy() end\n\n    local ContextMenu = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\n    ContextMenu.Name = \"ContextMenu\"\n    ContextMenu.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\n    ContextMenu.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    ContextMenu.Text = \"\"\n    ContextMenu.AutoButtonColor = false\n    ContextMenu.ZIndex = 10\n    ContextMenu:SetAttribute(\"TargetUserId\", plr.UserId)\n\n    ContextMenu.Activated:Connect(function() ContextMenu:Destroy() end)\n    ContextMenu.MouseButton2Click:Connect(function() ContextMenu:Destroy() end)\n\n    local mouse = UserInputService:GetMouseLocation()\n    local viewportSize = workspace.CurrentCamera.ViewportSize\n\n    local Menu = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    Menu.Name = \"Menu\"\n    Menu.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(220, 0)\n    Menu.AutomaticSize = Enum.AutomaticSize.Y\n    Menu.BackgroundColor3 = BgColor\n    Menu.Active = true\n    Menu.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(\n        math.clamp(mouse.X, 0, viewportSize.X - 230),\n        math.clamp(mouse.Y, 0, math.max(0, viewportSize.Y - 300))\n    )\n    Menu.Parent = ContextMenu\n    addCorner(Menu, 8)\n\n    local pad = Instance.new(\"UIPadding\")\n    pad.PaddingTop = UDim.new(0, 6)\n    pad.PaddingBottom = UDim.new(0, 6)\n    pad.PaddingLeft = UDim.new(0, 6)\n    pad.PaddingRight = UDim.new(0, 6)\n    pad.Parent = Menu\n\n    local list = Instance.new(\"UIListLayout\")\n    list.SortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder\n    list.Padding = UDim.new(0, 2)\n    list.Parent = Menu\n\n    -- Header\n    local Header = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    Header.Name = \"Header\"\n    Header.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 0)\n    Header.AutomaticSize = Enum.AutomaticSize.Y\n    Header.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    Header.LayoutOrder = 0\n    Header.Parent = Menu\n\n    local NameColumn = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    NameColumn.Name = \"NameColumn\"\n    NameColumn.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 0)\n    NameColumn.AutomaticSize = Enum.AutomaticSize.Y\n    NameColumn.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    NameColumn.Parent = Header\n\n    local columnList = Instance.new(\"UIListLayout\")\n    columnList.SortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder\n    columnList.Parent = NameColumn\n\n    makeLabel(NameColumn, \"DisplayName\", plr.DisplayName, 15, 1, SELF_FONT)\n    local username = makeLabel(NameColumn, \"Username\", \"@\" .. plr.Name, 12, 2)\n    username.TextColor3 = TEXT_COLOR\n\n    -- VIEW (abre o avatar)\n    makeAction(Menu, \"Action_examine\", 3, \"\", \"View\", function()\n        ContextMenu:Destroy()\n        openViewer(plr)\n    end, VIEW_COLOR, VIEW_HOVER_COLOR)\n\n    if not isSelf then\n        -- LIKE\n        if LikePlayer and HasLiked then\n            local likeButton\n            local liking = false\n\n            likeButton = makeAction(Menu, \"Action_like\", 4, \"\", \"\ud83d\udc4dLike\", function()\n                if liking or likeButton:GetAttribute(\"Liked\") then\n                    return\n                end\n\n                liking = true\n                likeButton.Label.Text = \"\ud83d\udc4d...\"\n\n                local ok, result = pcall(function()\n                    return LikePlayer:InvokeServer(plr.UserId)\n                end)\n\n                liking = false\n\n                if ok and (result == \"ok\" or result == \"already\") then\n                    likeButton:SetAttribute(\"Liked\", true)\n                    likeButton.Label.Text = \"\ud83d\udc4dLiked\"\n                    return\n                end\n\n                -- Feedback de erro (tamb\u00e9m aparece no Output)\n                if ok and result == \"busy\" then\n                    likeButton.Label.Text = \"\ud83d\udc4dAguarde\"\n                else\n                    likeButton.Label.Text = \"\ud83d\udc4dErro\"\n                end\n\n                warn(\"[Like] Falhou:\", ok and result or (\"InvokeServer: \" .. tostring(result)))\n\n                task.delay(2, function()\n                    if likeButton.Parent and not likeButton:GetAttribute(\"Liked\") then\n                        likeButton.Label.Text = \"\ud83d\udc4dLike\"\n                    end\n                end)\n            end)\n\n            -- Confere se j\u00e1 curtiu antes\n            task.spawn(function()\n                local ok, liked = pcall(function()\n                    return HasLiked:InvokeServer(plr.UserId)\n                end)\n\n                if ok and liked and likeButton.Parent then\n                    likeButton:SetAttribute(\"Liked\", true)\n                    likeButton.Label.Text = \"\ud83d\udc4dLiked\"\n                end\n            end)\n        end\n\n        makeAction(Menu, \"Action_friend\", 5, \"\ud83d\udc64\",\n            friend and \"Friends\" or \"Connection Request\",\n            function()\n                ContextMenu:Destroy()\n                pcall(function()\n                    StarterGui:SetCore(friend and \"PromptUnfriend\" or \"PromptSendFriendRequest\", plr)\n                end)\n            end\n        )\n\n        makeAction(Menu, \"Action_report\", 6, \"\u26a0\", \"Report\", function()\n            ContextMenu:Destroy()\n            -- Tentativa de abrir o menu de report (pode n\u00e3o existir em todas as vers\u00f5es)\n            pcall(function()\n                StarterGui:SetCore(\"ReportAbuseMenu\", plr)\n            end)\n        end)\n    end\n\n    ContextMenu.Parent = GUI -- dispara o GUI.ChildAdded l\u00e1 embaixo\nend\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- BOT\u00d5ES EXTRAS DO MENU (Teleport / Spectate)\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal spectating = false\n\nGUI.ChildAdded:Connect(function(c)\n    if c.Name == \"ContextMenu\" then\n        addShadow(c.Menu)\n\n        local ID = c:GetAttribute(\"TargetUserId\")\n\n        c.Menu.Action_examine.Label.Text = \"View\"\n\n        if not c.Menu:FindFirstChild(\"Action_friend\") then return end\n\n        c.Menu.Action_friend.Label.Text = c.Menu.Action_friend.Label.Text == \"Connection Request\" and \"Add Friend\" or \"Unfriend\"\n        c.Menu.Action_report.Label.Text = \"Report\"\n\n        -- TELEPORT (texto branco)\n        local TeleportButton = c.Menu.Action_friend:Clone()\n        TeleportButton.Name = \"Action_teleport\"\n        TeleportButton.Label.Text = \"Teleport\"\n        TeleportButton.Icon.Text = \"\u00bb\"\n        TeleportButton.LayoutOrder = 7\n        TeleportButton:SetAttribute(\"BaseColor\", WHITE)\n        TeleportButton:SetAttribute(\"HoverColor\", WHITE)\n        TeleportButton.Label.TextColor3 = WHITE\n        TeleportButton.Icon.TextColor3 = WHITE\n        TeleportButton.Parent = c.Menu\n\n        TeleportButton.Activated:Connect(function()\n            local target = Players:GetPlayerByUserId(ID)\n            local myChar = LocalPlr.Character\n\n            if target and target.Character and myChar then\n                myChar:PivotTo(target.Character:GetPivot())\n            end\n\n            c:Destroy()\n        end)\n\n        -- SPECTATE\n        local SpecButton = c.Menu.Action_friend:Clone()\n        SpecButton.Name = \"Action_spectate\"\n        SpecButton.Label.Text = spectating and \"Stop Spectating\" or \"Spectate\"\n        SpecButton.Icon.Text = spectating and \"\ud83d\udeab\" or \"\ud83d\udc41\"\n        SpecButton.LayoutOrder = 8\n        SpecButton.Parent = c.Menu\n\n        SpecButton.Activated:Connect(function()\n            local cam = workspace.CurrentCamera\n\n            if spectating then\n                spectating = false\n                local myHum = LocalPlr.Character and LocalPlr.Character:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"Humanoid\")\n                if myHum then cam.CameraSubject = myHum end\n                cam.CameraType = Enum.CameraType.Custom\n                c:Destroy()\n                return\n            end\n\n            local plr = Players:GetPlayerByUserId(ID)\n            local hum = plr and plr.Character and plr.Character:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"Humanoid\")\n            if not hum then return end\n\n            spectating = true\n            cam.CameraSubject = hum\n            cam.CameraType = Enum.CameraType.Custom\n            c:Destroy()\n        end)\n\n        -- Hover (cada bot\u00e3o volta para a pr\u00f3pria cor base)\n        for _, v in pairs(c.Menu:GetChildren()) do\n            if v:IsA(\"ImageButton\") then\n                local base = v:GetAttribute(\"BaseColor\") or TEXT_COLOR\n                local hover = v:GetAttribute(\"HoverColor\") or WHITE\n\n                v.MouseEnter:Connect(function()\n                    v.Label.TextColor3 = hover\n                    v.Icon.TextColor3 = hover\n                end)\n\n                v.MouseLeave:Connect(function()\n                    v.Label.TextColor3 = base\n                    v.Icon.TextColor3 = base\n                end)\n            end\n        end\n    end\nend)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- TAB ESCONDE / MOSTRA\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nUserInputService.InputBegan:Connect(function(input, processed)\n    if not processed and input.KeyCode == Enum.KeyCode.Tab then\n        Container.Visible = not Container.Visible\n    end\nend)\n```\n\n## Se os likes ainda n\u00e3o funcionarem\nTeste com 2 jogadores, tente curtir e me diga **o que aparece no bot\u00e3o** e **o que aparece no Output** (as linhas que come\u00e7am com `[PlayerLikes]` ou `[Like]`). Com isso eu identifico o problema na hora:\n\n| O que voc\u00ea v\u00ea | Significado |\n|---|---|\n| Bot\u00e3o \"\ud83d\udc4dLike\" **n\u00e3o aparece** | Remotes n\u00e3o chegaram ao cliente. O script `PlayerLikes` n\u00e3o est\u00e1 rodando como Script em ServerScriptService. |\n| Bot\u00e3o vira `\ud83d\udc4dErro` e o Output mostra \"DataStore falhou\" | API Services desligado no Studio, ou DataStore indispon\u00edvel. |\n| Bot\u00e3o vira `\ud83d\udc4dLiked`, mas a coluna Likes n\u00e3o sobe | O valor est\u00e1 sendo gravado, mas o stat `Likes` n\u00e3o est\u00e1 chegando ao cliente. Pode ser conflito com o seu m\u00f3dulo `Leaderstats`. |", "content": [{"start_timestamp": "2026-10-31T21:15:43.899852Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-31T21:16:52.841298Z", "flags": null, "type": "thinking", "thinking": "", "summaries": [{"summary": "Diagnosing why the player list shows only one entry."}, {"summary": "Tracing how the player list's row sizes are counted."}, {"summary": "Checking when the script starts listening for players."}, {"summary": "Checking whether the panel's size updates after friend checks."}, {"summary": "Replacing the height bookkeeping with a layout-driven size."}, {"summary": "Splitting the Likes handling into server and client checks."}, {"summary": "Checking why the Like button does nothing."}, {"summary": "Adding visible feedback and warnings to the Like handling."}, {"summary": "Checking possible causes of the failing Like button."}, {"summary": "Finalizing the Like button feedback and the panel sizing."}, {"summary": "Rewriting the player list to size from its layout."}, {"summary": "Wiring the player list's join and leave handling."}, {"summary": "Adicionando avisos de diagn\u00f3stico ao servidor e ao cliente."}], "cut_off": false, "truncated": true, "hidden": false, "thinking_hidden": true, "alternative_display_type": null, "signature": null}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-10-31T21:16:52.841333Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-10-31T21:18:11.547153Z", "flags": null, "type": "text", "text": "Corrigi a playerlist e deixei os likes com diagn\u00f3stico claro. N\u00e3o consigo ver o seu Output, ent\u00e3o no caso dos likes n\u00e3o d\u00e1 para cravar a causa s\u00f3 pelo c\u00f3digo. Agora o bot\u00e3o mostra o erro na tela, e o servidor escreve o motivo no Output.\n\n## O que causava a playerlist pequena\n- O script esperava a checagem de amizade (`IsFriendsWithAsync`) de **cada jogador, um por vez**, antes de terminar de montar o painel. Com v\u00e1rios jogadores isso demora, e o painel ficava pequeno nesse meio tempo.\n- O evento `PlayerAdded` s\u00f3 era conectado no **final** do script. Quem entrava durante a espera ficava sem linha.\n- A altura do painel dependia de uma conta feita na m\u00e3o (`playersSize`), que ficava errada com essas esperas.\n\n**Corre\u00e7\u00f5es:**\n- A amizade agora \u00e9 checada em segundo plano, sem travar nada.\n- Os eventos de entrada e sa\u00edda s\u00e3o conectados logo no in\u00edcio.\n- A altura vem direto do tamanho real da lista (`AbsoluteContentSize`), ent\u00e3o acompanha a quantidade de jogadores. Ela tem um limite m\u00e1ximo e passa a rolar quando a lista \u00e9 muito grande.\n\n## Poss\u00edveis causas dos likes\n1. **Teste com um jogador s\u00f3.** N\u00e3o d\u00e1 para curtir a si mesmo, e o bot\u00e3o nem aparece no seu pr\u00f3prio menu. Teste em **Test > Clients and Servers** com 2 jogadores.\n2. **DataStore desligado no Studio.** Ative em **Game Settings > Security > Enable Studio Access to API Services**. Sem isso, toda leitura e grava\u00e7\u00e3o falha.\n3. **Script de servidor no lugar errado.** Ele precisa ser um **Script** (n\u00e3o LocalScript) dentro de **ServerScriptService**. Se ele n\u00e3o rodar, o bot\u00e3o \"\ud83d\udc4dLike\" nem aparece.\n\nAgora, ao clicar em Like, o bot\u00e3o mostra o que aconteceu: `\ud83d\udc4d...` enquanto envia, `\ud83d\udc4dLiked` se deu certo, `\ud83d\udc4dErro` se falhou, `\ud83d\udc4dAguarde` se clicou r\u00e1pido demais.\n\n---\n\n## 1) Script de servidor (substitua o `PlayerLikes`)\n\n```lua\n--// PlayerLikes\n--// Script em ServerScriptService\n\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal DataStoreService = game:GetService(\"DataStoreService\")\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\n\nlocal store = DataStoreService:GetDataStore(\"PlayerLikes_v1\")\n\nlocal LIKE_COOLDOWN = 1 -- segundos entre likes do mesmo jogador\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- REMOTES\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal folder = Instance.new(\"Folder\")\nfolder.Name = \"PlayerLikes\"\nfolder.Parent = ReplicatedStorage\n\nlocal LikePlayer = Instance.new(\"RemoteFunction\")\nLikePlayer.Name = \"LikePlayer\"\nLikePlayer.Parent = folder\n\nlocal HasLiked = Instance.new(\"RemoteFunction\")\nHasLiked.Name = \"HasLiked\"\nHasLiked.Parent = folder\n\nprint(\"[PlayerLikes] Servidor de likes iniciado\")\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- UTILIDADES\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function retry(label, fn, tries)\n\ttries = tries or 3\n\n\tlocal lastError\n\n\tfor i = 1, tries do\n\t\tlocal ok, result = pcall(fn)\n\n\t\tif ok then\n\t\t\treturn true, result\n\t\tend\n\n\t\tlastError = result\n\t\ttask.wait(i)\n\tend\n\n\twarn(\"[PlayerLikes] DataStore falhou em '\" .. label .. \"':\", lastError)\n\n\treturn false, nil\nend\n\nlocal given = {}     -- given[player] = {[targetUserId] = true}\nlocal busy = {}      -- busy[player] = true enquanto processa\nlocal lastLike = {}  -- lastLike[player] = os.clock()\n\nlocal function ensureGiven(player)\n\tif given[player] then\n\t\treturn given[player]\n\tend\n\n\tlocal ok, list = retry(\"ler Given\", function()\n\t\treturn store:GetAsync(\"Given_\" .. player.UserId)\n\tend)\n\n\tif not ok then\n\t\treturn nil\n\tend\n\n\tlocal set = {}\n\n\tif type(list) == \"table\" then\n\t\tfor _, id in ipairs(list) do\n\t\t\tset[id] = true\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\tgiven[player] = set\n\n\treturn set\nend\n\nlocal function getStatsFolder(player)\n\tlocal stats = player:FindFirstChild(\"leaderstats\")\n\n\tif stats then\n\t\treturn stats\n\tend\n\n\t-- Espera o m\u00f3dulo Leaderstats criar\n\tstats = player:WaitForChild(\"leaderstats\", 5)\n\n\tif stats then\n\t\treturn stats\n\tend\n\n\tstats = Instance.new(\"Folder\")\n\tstats.Name = \"leaderstats\"\n\tstats.Parent = player\n\n\treturn stats\nend\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- JOGADOR ENTRA\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function onPlayerAdded(player)\n\tlocal stats = getStatsFolder(player)\n\n\tlocal likes = stats:FindFirstChild(\"Likes\")\n\n\tif not likes then\n\t\tlikes = Instance.new(\"IntValue\")\n\t\tlikes.Name = \"Likes\"\n\t\tlikes.Value = 0\n\t\tlikes.Parent = stats\n\tend\n\n\tlocal ok, received = retry(\"ler Received\", function()\n\t\treturn store:GetAsync(\"Received_\" .. player.UserId)\n\tend)\n\n\tif ok and type(received) == \"number\" then\n\t\tlikes.Value = received\n\tend\n\n\tensureGiven(player)\nend\n\nfor _, player in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do\n\ttask.spawn(onPlayerAdded, player)\nend\n\nPlayers.PlayerAdded:Connect(onPlayerAdded)\n\nPlayers.PlayerRemoving:Connect(function(player)\n\tgiven[player] = nil\n\tbusy[player] = nil\n\tlastLike[player] = nil\nend)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- DAR LIKE\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nLikePlayer.OnServerInvoke = function(player, targetUserId)\n\tif type(targetUserId) ~= \"number\" then\n\t\treturn \"invalid\"\n\tend\n\n\tlocal target = Players:GetPlayerByUserId(targetUserId)\n\n\tif not target or target == player then\n\t\treturn \"invalid\"\n\tend\n\n\tif busy[player] then\n\t\treturn \"busy\"\n\tend\n\n\tif lastLike[player] and os.clock() - lastLike[player] < LIKE_COOLDOWN then\n\t\treturn \"busy\"\n\tend\n\n\tbusy[player] = true\n\tlastLike[player] = os.clock()\n\n\tlocal result = \"error\"\n\n\tlocal success, err = pcall(function()\n\n\t\tlocal set = ensureGiven(player)\n\n\t\tif not set then\n\t\t\twarn(\"[PlayerLikes] N\u00e3o foi poss\u00edvel ler os likes de \" .. player.Name\n\t\t\t\t.. \". Em Studio, ative 'Enable Studio Access to API Services'.\")\n\t\t\tresult = \"error\"\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tend\n\n\t\tif set[targetUserId] then\n\t\t\tresult = \"already\"\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tend\n\n\t\t-- Soma +1 no total do jogador curtido (at\u00f4mico)\n\t\tlocal ok, newTotal = retry(\"somar Received\", function()\n\t\t\treturn store:UpdateAsync(\"Received_\" .. targetUserId, function(old)\n\t\t\t\treturn (tonumber(old) or 0) + 1\n\t\t\tend)\n\t\tend)\n\n\t\tif not ok then\n\t\t\tresult = \"error\"\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tend\n\n\t\tset[targetUserId] = true\n\n\t\t-- Registra que este jogador j\u00e1 curtiu esse alvo\n\t\tretry(\"gravar Given\", function()\n\t\t\treturn store:UpdateAsync(\"Given_\" .. player.UserId, function(old)\n\t\t\t\told = type(old) == \"table\" and old or {}\n\n\t\t\t\tif not table.find(old, targetUserId) then\n\t\t\t\t\ttable.insert(old, targetUserId)\n\t\t\t\tend\n\n\t\t\t\treturn old\n\t\t\tend)\n\t\tend)\n\n\t\t-- Atualiza o valor que aparece na playerlist\n\t\tlocal stats = target:FindFirstChild(\"leaderstats\")\n\t\tlocal likes = stats and stats:FindFirstChild(\"Likes\")\n\n\t\tif likes and type(newTotal) == \"number\" then\n\t\t\tlikes.Value = newTotal\n\t\tend\n\n\t\tresult = \"ok\"\n\tend)\n\n\tbusy[player] = nil\n\n\tif not success then\n\t\twarn(\"[PlayerLikes] Erro inesperado:\", err)\n\t\treturn \"error\"\n\tend\n\n\treturn result\nend\n\nHasLiked.OnServerInvoke = function(player, targetUserId)\n\tif type(targetUserId) ~= \"number\" then\n\t\treturn false\n\tend\n\n\tlocal set = ensureGiven(player)\n\n\treturn set ~= nil and set[targetUserId] == true\nend\n```\n\n---\n\n## 2) LocalScript da playerlist (substitua o conte\u00fado inteiro)\n\n```lua\n--// PlayerList Reskin\n--// LocalScript em StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts\n\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal StarterGui = game:GetService(\"StarterGui\")\nlocal RunService = game:GetService(\"RunService\")\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\nlocal UserInputService = game:GetService(\"UserInputService\")\n\nlocal LocalPlr = Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal PlayerGui = LocalPlr:WaitForChild(\"PlayerGui\")\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- CONFIGURA\u00c7\u00c3O\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal BgColor = Color3.fromRGB(49, 51, 56)\nlocal TEXT_COLOR = Color3.fromRGB(213, 215, 221)\nlocal WHITE = Color3.fromRGB(255, 255, 255)\nlocal FRIEND_COLOR = Color3.fromRGB(88, 214, 141)\nlocal SELF_COLOR = Color3.fromRGB(255, 213, 79)\n\nlocal VIEW_COLOR = Color3.fromRGB(74, 55, 106)\nlocal VIEW_HOVER_COLOR = Color3.fromRGB(130, 100, 185)\n\nlocal NORMAL_FONT = Font.new(\"rbxasset://fonts/families/GothamSSm.json\", Enum.FontWeight.Medium)\nlocal SELF_FONT = Font.new(\"rbxasset://fonts/families/GothamSSm.json\", Enum.FontWeight.Bold)\n\nlocal ROW_HEIGHT = 28\nlocal PANEL_BASE_WIDTH = 196\nlocal STAT_WIDTH = 84\n\nlocal HEADER_HEIGHT = 44  -- espa\u00e7o do t\u00edtulo\nlocal FOOTER_HEIGHT = 8   -- margem de baixo\n\n-- Stats do leaderstats que voc\u00ea N\u00c3O quer mostrar. Ex: {Coins = true}\nlocal HIDDEN_STATS = {}\n\n-- Ordem das colunas (as que n\u00e3o est\u00e3o aqui v\u00e3o depois)\nlocal STAT_ORDER = { \"Spent\", \"Likes\" }\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- REMOTES DE LIKE (criados pelo script PlayerLikes no servidor)\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal LikePlayer, HasLiked\n\ntask.spawn(function()\n    local folder = ReplicatedStorage:WaitForChild(\"PlayerLikes\", 15)\n\n    if not folder then\n        warn(\"[Playerlist] Remotes de like n\u00e3o encontrados. O script PlayerLikes est\u00e1 em ServerScriptService (como Script)?\")\n        return\n    end\n\n    LikePlayer = folder:WaitForChild(\"LikePlayer\", 5)\n    HasLiked = folder:WaitForChild(\"HasLiked\", 5)\nend)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- DESATIVA O LEADERBOARD PADR\u00c3O\n--------------------------------------------------\n\ntask.spawn(function()\n    for _ = 1, 10 do\n        local ok = pcall(function()\n            StarterGui:SetCoreGuiEnabled(Enum.CoreGuiType.PlayerList, false)\n        end)\n        if ok then break end\n        task.wait(0.5)\n    end\nend)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- FUN\u00c7\u00d5ES AUXILIARES\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function addShadow(parent)\n    -- Se a sua vers\u00e3o do Studio n\u00e3o tiver UIShadow, simplesmente ignora\n    pcall(function()\n        local shadow = Instance.new(\"UIShadow\")\n        shadow.Transparency = 0.5\n        shadow.BlurRadius = UDim.new(0, 10)\n        shadow.Parent = parent\n    end)\nend\n\nlocal function addCorner(parent, radius)\n    local corner = Instance.new(\"UICorner\")\n    corner.CornerRadius = UDim.new(0, radius)\n    corner.Parent = parent\nend\n\nlocal friendCache = {}\n\nlocal function checkFriend(userId, fresh)\n    if userId == LocalPlr.UserId then\n        return false\n    end\n\n    if not fresh and friendCache[userId] ~= nil then\n        return friendCache[userId]\n    end\n\n    local ok, result = pcall(function()\n        return LocalPlr:IsFriendsWithAsync(userId)\n    end)\n\n    friendCache[userId] = ok and result == true\n    return friendCache[userId]\nend\n\nlocal function makeLabel(parent, name, text, size, order, font)\n    local label = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\n    label.Name = name\n    label.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    label.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, size + 4)\n    label.Text = text\n    label.TextColor3 = WHITE\n    label.FontFace = font or NORMAL_FONT\n    label.TextSize = size\n    label.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left\n    label.TextTruncate = Enum.TextTruncate.AtEnd\n    label.LayoutOrder = order\n    label.Parent = parent\n    return label\nend\n\nlocal function formatValue(value)\n    if type(value) == \"number\" then\n        local int = math.floor(value)\n\n        if int == value then\n            local sign = int < 0 and \"-\" or \"\"\n            local s = tostring(math.abs(int))\n            local formatted = s:reverse():gsub(\"(%d%d%d)\", \"%1,\"):reverse()\n            formatted = formatted:gsub(\"^,\", \"\")\n            return sign .. formatted\n        end\n\n        return tostring(math.floor(value * 100) / 100)\n    end\n\n    return tostring(value)\nend\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- CRIA O GUI\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal GUI = Instance.new(\"ScreenGui\")\nGUI.Name = \"PlayerListReskin\"\nGUI.ResetOnSpawn = false\nGUI.IgnoreGuiInset = true\nGUI.DisplayOrder = 10\nGUI.Parent = PlayerGui\n\nlocal Container = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nContainer.Name = \"Container\"\nContainer.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\nContainer.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nContainer.Parent = GUI\n\nlocal Panel = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nPanel.Name = \"PlayerListPanel\"\nPanel.AnchorPoint = Vector2.new(1, 0)\nPanel.Position = UDim2.new(1, -10, 0, 50)\nPanel.Size = UDim2.new(0, PANEL_BASE_WIDTH, 0, HEADER_HEIGHT + ROW_HEIGHT + FOOTER_HEIGHT)\nPanel.BackgroundColor3 = BgColor\nPanel.BackgroundTransparency = 0.1\nPanel.BorderSizePixel = 0\nPanel.Parent = Container\naddCorner(Panel, 8)\n\nlocal LeaderboardBody = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nLeaderboardBody.Name = \"LeaderboardBody\"\nLeaderboardBody.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\nLeaderboardBody.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nLeaderboardBody.Parent = Panel\n\nlocal Title = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\nTitle.Name = \"Title\"\nTitle.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(12, 8)\nTitle.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(80, 28)\nTitle.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nTitle.Text = \"Players\"\nTitle.TextColor3 = WHITE\nTitle.FontFace = SELF_FONT\nTitle.TextSize = 16\nTitle.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left\nTitle.Parent = LeaderboardBody\n\n-- Cabe\u00e7alho das colunas de stats (Spent, Likes, etc.)\nlocal StatsHeader = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nStatsHeader.Name = \"StatsHeader\"\nStatsHeader.AnchorPoint = Vector2.new(1, 0)\nStatsHeader.Position = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 8)\nStatsHeader.Size = UDim2.new(0, 0, 0, 28)\nStatsHeader.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nStatsHeader.Parent = LeaderboardBody\n\nlocal headerList = Instance.new(\"UIListLayout\")\nheaderList.FillDirection = Enum.FillDirection.Horizontal\nheaderList.SortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder\nheaderList.Parent = StatsHeader\n\nlocal PlayerRows = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nPlayerRows.Name = \"PlayerRows\"\nPlayerRows.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(0, HEADER_HEIGHT)\nPlayerRows.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 1, -(HEADER_HEIGHT + FOOTER_HEIGHT))\nPlayerRows.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nPlayerRows.Parent = LeaderboardBody\n\nlocal PlayersContainer = Instance.new(\"ScrollingFrame\")\nPlayersContainer.Name = \"ScrollingFrame\"\nPlayersContainer.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\nPlayersContainer.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nPlayersContainer.BorderSizePixel = 0\nPlayersContainer.ScrollBarThickness = 3\nPlayersContainer.CanvasSize = UDim2.new()\nPlayersContainer.AutomaticCanvasSize = Enum.AutomaticSize.Y\nPlayersContainer.Parent = PlayerRows\n\n-- \"Time\" \u00fanico que cont\u00e9m todas as linhas\nlocal TeamFrame = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\nTeamFrame.Name = \"Players\"\nTeamFrame.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 0)\nTeamFrame.AutomaticSize = Enum.AutomaticSize.Y\nTeamFrame.BackgroundTransparency = 1\nTeamFrame.Parent = PlayersContainer\n\nlocal TeamList = Instance.new(\"UIListLayout\")\nTeamList.SortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder\nTeamList.Parent = TeamFrame\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- ESTADO COMPARTILHADO\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal updatePanel -- definida logo abaixo\n\nlocal statNames = {}    -- ordem das colunas\nlocal statIndex = {}    -- statIndex[nome] = posi\u00e7\u00e3o\nlocal headerLabels = {} -- headerLabels[nome] = TextLabel\nlocal rowRefs = {}      -- rowRefs[player] = {row, nameText, statsFrame, labels, destroyed}\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- TAMANHO DO PAINEL (acompanha a quantidade real de linhas)\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function statsWidth()\n    return #statNames * STAT_WIDTH\nend\n\nupdatePanel = function()\n    local content = TeamList.AbsoluteContentSize.Y\n\n    local camera = workspace.CurrentCamera\n    local viewportHeight = camera and camera.ViewportSize.Y or 720\n    local maxHeight = math.max(120, viewportHeight - 120)\n\n    local height = math.min(HEADER_HEIGHT + content + FOOTER_HEIGHT, maxHeight)\n\n    Panel.Size = UDim2.new(0, PANEL_BASE_WIDTH + statsWidth(), 0, height)\nend\n\nTeamList:GetPropertyChangedSignal(\"AbsoluteContentSize\"):Connect(updatePanel)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- COLUNAS DE STATS (leaderstats)\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function applyRowLayout(ref)\n    local width = statsWidth()\n    ref.statsFrame.Size = UDim2.new(0, width, 1, 0)\n    ref.nameText.Size = UDim2.new(1, -(18 + width), 1, 0)\nend\n\nlocal function createStatLabel(parent, name, text, textSize)\n    local label = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\n    label.Name = name\n    label.Size = UDim2.new(0, STAT_WIDTH, 1, 0)\n    label.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    label.Text = text\n    label.TextColor3 = TEXT_COLOR\n    label.FontFace = NORMAL_FONT\n    label.TextSize = textSize\n    label.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Right\n    label.TextTruncate = Enum.TextTruncate.AtEnd\n    label.LayoutOrder = statIndex[name]\n    label.Parent = parent\n\n    local pad = Instance.new(\"UIPadding\")\n    pad.PaddingRight = UDim.new(0, 8)\n    pad.Parent = label\n\n    return label\nend\n\nlocal function getStatLabel(ref, name)\n    local label = ref.labels[name]\n\n    if label then\n        return label\n    end\n\n    label = createStatLabel(ref.statsFrame, name, \"-\", 13)\n    ref.labels[name] = label\n\n    return label\nend\n\nlocal function statPriority(name)\n    for i, v in ipairs(STAT_ORDER) do\n        if v == name then\n            return i\n        end\n    end\n\n    return #STAT_ORDER + 1\nend\n\nlocal function reindexStats()\n    local seq = {}\n\n    for i, name in ipairs(statNames) do\n        seq[name] = i\n    end\n\n    table.sort(statNames, function(a, b)\n        local pa, pb = statPriority(a), statPriority(b)\n\n        if pa ~= pb then\n            return pa < pb\n        end\n\n        return seq[a] < seq[b]\n    end)\n\n    for i, name in ipairs(statNames) do\n        statIndex[name] = i\n\n        if headerLabels[name] then\n            headerLabels[name].LayoutOrder = i\n        end\n\n        for _, ref in pairs(rowRefs) do\n            local label = ref.labels[name]\n\n            if label then\n                label.LayoutOrder = i\n            end\n        end\n    end\nend\n\nlocal function refreshStatsLayout()\n    for _, ref in pairs(rowRefs) do\n        applyRowLayout(ref)\n    end\n\n    StatsHeader.Size = UDim2.new(0, statsWidth(), 0, 28)\n\n    updatePanel()\nend\n\nlocal function registerStat(name)\n    if HIDDEN_STATS[name] or statIndex[name] then\n        return\n    end\n\n    table.insert(statNames, name)\n    statIndex[name] = #statNames\n\n    headerLabels[name] = createStatLabel(StatsHeader, name, name, 12)\n\n    for _, ref in pairs(rowRefs) do\n        getStatLabel(ref, name)\n    end\n\n    reindexStats()\n    refreshStatsLayout()\nend\n\nlocal function bindValue(ref, valueObj)\n    if not valueObj:IsA(\"ValueBase\") then\n        return\n    end\n\n    local name = valueObj.Name\n\n    if HIDDEN_STATS[name] then\n        return\n    end\n\n    registerStat(name)\n\n    local label = getStatLabel(ref, name)\n\n    local function update()\n        label.Text = formatValue(valueObj.Value)\n    end\n\n    update()\n\n    valueObj:GetPropertyChangedSignal(\"Value\"):Connect(update)\nend\n\nlocal function trackPlayer(plr, ref)\n    task.spawn(function()\n        local stats = plr:WaitForChild(\"leaderstats\", 30)\n\n        if not stats or ref.destroyed then\n            return\n        end\n\n        for _, v in ipairs(stats:GetChildren()) do\n            bindValue(ref, v)\n        end\n\n        stats.ChildAdded:Connect(function(v)\n            if not ref.destroyed then\n                bindValue(ref, v)\n            end\n        end)\n    end)\nend\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- CORES (amigo / voc\u00ea) - sem travar o script\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function styleRow(row)\n    local userId = tonumber(row.Name:match(\"^Player_(%d+)$\"))\n\n    if not userId then\n        return\n    end\n\n    local nameText = row:FindFirstChild(\"NameText\", true)\n\n    if not nameText then\n        return\n    end\n\n    if userId == LocalPlr.UserId then\n        nameText.TextColor3 = SELF_COLOR\n        nameText.FontFace = SELF_FONT\n        return\n    end\n\n    -- A checagem de amizade roda em segundo plano\n    task.spawn(function()\n        local isFriend = checkFriend(userId)\n\n        if isFriend and nameText.Parent then\n            nameText.TextColor3 = FRIEND_COLOR\n        end\n    end)\nend\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- CRIA AS LINHAS\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal rowCount = 0\nlocal openContextMenu -- definido mais abaixo\n\nlocal function createRow(plr)\n    -- Evita linha duplicada\n    if rowRefs[plr] then\n        return rowRefs[plr].row\n    end\n\n    rowCount += 1\n\n    local row = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    row.Name = \"Player_\" .. plr.UserId\n    row.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, ROW_HEIGHT)\n    row.BackgroundColor3 = WHITE\n    row.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    row.LayoutOrder = rowCount\n    addCorner(row, 5)\n\n    local content = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    content.Name = \"RowContent\"\n    content.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\n    content.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    content.Parent = row\n\n    local cell = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    cell.Name = \"PeopleCell\"\n    cell.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\n    cell.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    cell.Parent = content\n\n    local nameText = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\n    nameText.Name = \"NameText\"\n    nameText.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(12, 0)\n    nameText.Size = UDim2.new(1, -20, 1, 0)\n    nameText.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    nameText.Text = plr.DisplayName\n    nameText.TextColor3 = TEXT_COLOR\n    nameText.FontFace = NORMAL_FONT\n    nameText.TextSize = 14\n    nameText.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left\n    nameText.TextTruncate = Enum.TextTruncate.AtEnd\n    nameText.Parent = cell\n\n    -- Colunas de stats (\u00e0 direita)\n    local statsFrame = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    statsFrame.Name = \"Stats\"\n    statsFrame.AnchorPoint = Vector2.new(1, 0)\n    statsFrame.Position = UDim2.fromScale(1, 0)\n    statsFrame.Size = UDim2.new(0, 0, 1, 0)\n    statsFrame.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    statsFrame.Parent = cell\n\n    local statsList = Instance.new(\"UIListLayout\")\n    statsList.FillDirection = Enum.FillDirection.Horizontal\n    statsList.SortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder\n    statsList.Parent = statsFrame\n\n    local hitbox = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\n    hitbox.Name = \"Hitbox\"\n    hitbox.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\n    hitbox.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    hitbox.Text = \"\"\n    hitbox.ZIndex = 2\n    hitbox.Parent = cell\n\n    hitbox.MouseEnter:Connect(function() row.BackgroundTransparency = 0.9 end)\n    hitbox.MouseLeave:Connect(function() row.BackgroundTransparency = 1 end)\n    hitbox.Activated:Connect(function() openContextMenu(plr) end)\n    hitbox.MouseButton2Click:Connect(function() openContextMenu(plr) end)\n\n    local ref = {\n        row = row,\n        nameText = nameText,\n        statsFrame = statsFrame,\n        labels = {},\n        destroyed = false,\n    }\n\n    rowRefs[plr] = ref\n\n    for _, name in ipairs(statNames) do\n        getStatLabel(ref, name)\n    end\n\n    applyRowLayout(ref)\n    styleRow(row)\n\n    row.Parent = TeamFrame\n\n    trackPlayer(plr, ref)\n\n    return row\nend\n\nlocal function removeRow(plr)\n    local ref = rowRefs[plr]\n\n    if ref then\n        ref.destroyed = true\n        rowRefs[plr] = nil\n        ref.row:Destroy()\n    end\nend\n\n-- Conecta os eventos ANTES de criar as linhas (ningu\u00e9m fica de fora)\nPlayers.PlayerAdded:Connect(createRow)\nPlayers.PlayerRemoving:Connect(removeRow)\n\nfor _, plr in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do\n    createRow(plr)\nend\n\nupdatePanel()\naddShadow(Panel)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- VISUALIZADOR DE AVATAR (\"View\")\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal viewerConn\n\nlocal function closeViewer()\n    if viewerConn then\n        viewerConn:Disconnect()\n        viewerConn = nil\n    end\n\n    local old = GUI:FindFirstChild(\"AvatarViewer\")\n\n    if old then\n        old:Destroy()\n    end\nend\n\nlocal function buildAvatarModel(plr)\n    -- 1\u00aa op\u00e7\u00e3o: clona o personagem que est\u00e1 no jogo (o que ele est\u00e1 usando agora)\n    local char = plr.Character\n\n    if char then\n        local ok, clone = pcall(function()\n            char.Archivable = true\n            return char:Clone()\n        end)\n\n        if ok and clone then\n            for _, d in ipairs(clone:GetDescendants()) do\n                if d:IsA(\"BaseScript\") or d:IsA(\"Sound\") then\n                    d:Destroy()\n                end\n            end\n\n            return clone\n        end\n    end\n\n    -- 2\u00aa op\u00e7\u00e3o: monta o avatar a partir do perfil do jogador\n    local ok, model = pcall(function()\n        return Players:CreateHumanoidModelFromUserId(plr.UserId)\n    end)\n\n    if ok and model then\n        return model\n    end\n\n    return nil\nend\n\nlocal function openViewer(plr)\n    closeViewer()\n\n    local model = buildAvatarModel(plr)\n\n    if not model then\n        warn(\"N\u00e3o foi poss\u00edvel carregar o avatar de \" .. plr.Name)\n        return\n    end\n\n    local backdrop = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\n    backdrop.Name = \"AvatarViewer\"\n    backdrop.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\n    backdrop.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.new(0, 0, 0)\n    backdrop.BackgroundTransparency = 0.5\n    backdrop.Text = \"\"\n    backdrop.AutoButtonColor = false\n    backdrop.ZIndex = 20\n    backdrop.Activated:Connect(closeViewer)\n    backdrop.Parent = GUI\n\n    local window = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    window.Name = \"Window\"\n    window.AnchorPoint = Vector2.new(0.5, 0.5)\n    window.Position = UDim2.fromScale(0.5, 0.5)\n    window.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(320, 440)\n    window.BackgroundColor3 = BgColor\n    window.Active = true\n    window.ZIndex = 21\n    window.Parent = backdrop\n    addCorner(window, 10)\n    addShadow(window)\n\n    local title = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\n    title.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(14, 10)\n    title.Size = UDim2.new(1, -60, 0, 28)\n    title.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    title.Text = plr.DisplayName .. \" (@\" .. plr.Name .. \")\"\n    title.TextColor3 = WHITE\n    title.FontFace = SELF_FONT\n    title.TextSize = 16\n    title.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left\n    title.TextTruncate = Enum.TextTruncate.AtEnd\n    title.Parent = window\n\n    local close = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\n    close.AnchorPoint = Vector2.new(1, 0)\n    close.Position = UDim2.new(1, -10, 0, 10)\n    close.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(28, 28)\n    close.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    close.Text = \"\u2715\"\n    close.TextColor3 = TEXT_COLOR\n    close.TextSize = 16\n    close.Font = Enum.Font.GothamBold\n    close.Parent = window\n    close.Activated:Connect(closeViewer)\n\n    local viewport = Instance.new(\"ViewportFrame\")\n    viewport.Name = \"Viewport\"\n    viewport.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(12, 48)\n    viewport.Size = UDim2.new(1, -24, 1, -60)\n    viewport.BackgroundColor3 = Color3.fromRGB(35, 37, 41)\n    viewport.BorderSizePixel = 0\n    viewport.Ambient = Color3.fromRGB(190, 190, 190)\n    viewport.LightColor = WHITE\n    viewport.Parent = window\n    addCorner(viewport, 8)\n\n    local cam = Instance.new(\"Camera\")\n    cam.FieldOfView = 40\n    cam.Parent = viewport\n    viewport.CurrentCamera = cam\n\n    model.Parent = viewport\n\n    local cf, size = model:GetBoundingBox()\n    local halfFov = math.rad(cam.FieldOfView / 2)\n    local distance = (size.Y / 2) / math.tan(halfFov) * 1.15 + size.Z / 2\n\n    cam.CFrame = CFrame.lookAt(cf.Position + cf.LookVector * distance, cf.Position)\n\n    -- Gira o avatar devagar\n    viewerConn = RunService.RenderStepped:Connect(function(dt)\n        if model.Parent then\n            model:PivotTo(model:GetPivot() * CFrame.Angles(0, dt * 0.8, 0))\n        end\n    end)\nend\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- MENU DE CONTEXTO (criado ao clicar num jogador)\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal function makeAction(menu, name, order, icon, text, callback, baseColor, hoverColor)\n    baseColor = baseColor or TEXT_COLOR\n    hoverColor = hoverColor or WHITE\n\n    local button = Instance.new(\"ImageButton\")\n    button.Name = name\n    button.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 30)\n    button.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    button.Image = \"\"\n    button.AutoButtonColor = false\n    button.LayoutOrder = order\n    button:SetAttribute(\"BaseColor\", baseColor)\n    button:SetAttribute(\"HoverColor\", hoverColor)\n    button.Parent = menu\n\n    local iconLabel = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\n    iconLabel.Name = \"Icon\"\n    iconLabel.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(6, 0)\n    iconLabel.Size = UDim2.new(0, 24, 1, 0)\n    iconLabel.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    iconLabel.Text = icon\n    iconLabel.TextColor3 = baseColor\n    iconLabel.TextSize = 16\n    iconLabel.Font = Enum.Font.GothamMedium\n    iconLabel.Parent = button\n\n    local label = Instance.new(\"TextLabel\")\n    label.Name = \"Label\"\n    label.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(36, 0)\n    label.Size = UDim2.new(1, -40, 1, 0)\n    label.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    label.Text = text\n    label.TextColor3 = baseColor\n    label.FontFace = NORMAL_FONT\n    label.TextSize = 14\n    label.TextXAlignment = Enum.TextXAlignment.Left\n    label.Parent = button\n\n    button.Activated:Connect(callback)\n\n    return button\nend\n\nfunction openContextMenu(plr)\n    local isSelf = plr == LocalPlr\n    local friend = false\n\n    if not isSelf then\n        friend = checkFriend(plr.UserId, true)\n    end\n\n    if not plr.Parent then\n        return\n    end\n\n    local old = GUI:FindFirstChild(\"ContextMenu\")\n    if old then old:Destroy() end\n\n    local ContextMenu = Instance.new(\"TextButton\")\n    ContextMenu.Name = \"ContextMenu\"\n    ContextMenu.Size = UDim2.fromScale(1, 1)\n    ContextMenu.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    ContextMenu.Text = \"\"\n    ContextMenu.AutoButtonColor = false\n    ContextMenu.ZIndex = 10\n    ContextMenu:SetAttribute(\"TargetUserId\", plr.UserId)\n\n    ContextMenu.Activated:Connect(function() ContextMenu:Destroy() end)\n    ContextMenu.MouseButton2Click:Connect(function() ContextMenu:Destroy() end)\n\n    local mouse = UserInputService:GetMouseLocation()\n    local viewportSize = workspace.CurrentCamera.ViewportSize\n\n    local Menu = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    Menu.Name = \"Menu\"\n    Menu.Size = UDim2.fromOffset(220, 0)\n    Menu.AutomaticSize = Enum.AutomaticSize.Y\n    Menu.BackgroundColor3 = BgColor\n    Menu.Active = true\n    Menu.Position = UDim2.fromOffset(\n        math.clamp(mouse.X, 0, viewportSize.X - 230),\n        math.clamp(mouse.Y, 0, math.max(0, viewportSize.Y - 300))\n    )\n    Menu.Parent = ContextMenu\n    addCorner(Menu, 8)\n\n    local pad = Instance.new(\"UIPadding\")\n    pad.PaddingTop = UDim.new(0, 6)\n    pad.PaddingBottom = UDim.new(0, 6)\n    pad.PaddingLeft = UDim.new(0, 6)\n    pad.PaddingRight = UDim.new(0, 6)\n    pad.Parent = Menu\n\n    local list = Instance.new(\"UIListLayout\")\n    list.SortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder\n    list.Padding = UDim.new(0, 2)\n    list.Parent = Menu\n\n    -- Header\n    local Header = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    Header.Name = \"Header\"\n    Header.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 0)\n    Header.AutomaticSize = Enum.AutomaticSize.Y\n    Header.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    Header.LayoutOrder = 0\n    Header.Parent = Menu\n\n    local NameColumn = Instance.new(\"Frame\")\n    NameColumn.Name = \"NameColumn\"\n    NameColumn.Size = UDim2.new(1, 0, 0, 0)\n    NameColumn.AutomaticSize = Enum.AutomaticSize.Y\n    NameColumn.BackgroundTransparency = 1\n    NameColumn.Parent = Header\n\n    local columnList = Instance.new(\"UIListLayout\")\n    columnList.SortOrder = Enum.SortOrder.LayoutOrder\n    columnList.Parent = NameColumn\n\n    makeLabel(NameColumn, \"DisplayName\", plr.DisplayName, 15, 1, SELF_FONT)\n    local username = makeLabel(NameColumn, \"Username\", \"@\" .. plr.Name, 12, 2)\n    username.TextColor3 = TEXT_COLOR\n\n    -- VIEW (abre o avatar)\n    makeAction(Menu, \"Action_examine\", 3, \"\", \"View\", function()\n        ContextMenu:Destroy()\n        openViewer(plr)\n    end, VIEW_COLOR, VIEW_HOVER_COLOR)\n\n    if not isSelf then\n        -- LIKE\n        if LikePlayer and HasLiked then\n            local likeButton\n            local liking = false\n\n            likeButton = makeAction(Menu, \"Action_like\", 4, \"\", \"\ud83d\udc4dLike\", function()\n                if liking or likeButton:GetAttribute(\"Liked\") then\n                    return\n                end\n\n                liking = true\n                likeButton.Label.Text = \"\ud83d\udc4d...\"\n\n                local ok, result = pcall(function()\n                    return LikePlayer:InvokeServer(plr.UserId)\n                end)\n\n                liking = false\n\n                if ok and (result == \"ok\" or result == \"already\") then\n                    likeButton:SetAttribute(\"Liked\", true)\n                    likeButton.Label.Text = \"\ud83d\udc4dLiked\"\n                    return\n                end\n\n                -- Feedback de erro (tamb\u00e9m aparece no Output)\n                if ok and result == \"busy\" then\n                    likeButton.Label.Text = \"\ud83d\udc4dAguarde\"\n                else\n                    likeButton.Label.Text = \"\ud83d\udc4dErro\"\n                end\n\n                warn(\"[Like] Falhou:\", ok and result or (\"InvokeServer: \" .. tostring(result)))\n\n                task.delay(2, function()\n                    if likeButton.Parent and not likeButton:GetAttribute(\"Liked\") then\n                        likeButton.Label.Text = \"\ud83d\udc4dLike\"\n                    end\n                end)\n            end)\n\n            -- Confere se j\u00e1 curtiu antes\n            task.spawn(function()\n                local ok, liked = pcall(function()\n                    return HasLiked:InvokeServer(plr.UserId)\n                end)\n\n                if ok and liked and likeButton.Parent then\n                    likeButton:SetAttribute(\"Liked\", true)\n                    likeButton.Label.Text = \"\ud83d\udc4dLiked\"\n                end\n            end)\n        end\n\n        makeAction(Menu, \"Action_friend\", 5, \"\ud83d\udc64\",\n            friend and \"Friends\" or \"Connection Request\",\n            function()\n                ContextMenu:Destroy()\n                pcall(function()\n                    StarterGui:SetCore(friend and \"PromptUnfriend\" or \"PromptSendFriendRequest\", plr)\n                end)\n            end\n        )\n\n        makeAction(Menu, \"Action_report\", 6, \"\u26a0\", \"Report\", function()\n            ContextMenu:Destroy()\n            -- Tentativa de abrir o menu de report (pode n\u00e3o existir em todas as vers\u00f5es)\n            pcall(function()\n                StarterGui:SetCore(\"ReportAbuseMenu\", plr)\n            end)\n        end)\n    end\n\n    ContextMenu.Parent = GUI -- dispara o GUI.ChildAdded l\u00e1 embaixo\nend\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- BOT\u00d5ES EXTRAS DO MENU (Teleport / Spectate)\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nlocal spectating = false\n\nGUI.ChildAdded:Connect(function(c)\n    if c.Name == \"ContextMenu\" then\n        addShadow(c.Menu)\n\n        local ID = c:GetAttribute(\"TargetUserId\")\n\n        c.Menu.Action_examine.Label.Text = \"View\"\n\n        if not c.Menu:FindFirstChild(\"Action_friend\") then return end\n\n        c.Menu.Action_friend.Label.Text = c.Menu.Action_friend.Label.Text == \"Connection Request\" and \"Add Friend\" or \"Unfriend\"\n        c.Menu.Action_report.Label.Text = \"Report\"\n\n        -- TELEPORT (texto branco)\n        local TeleportButton = c.Menu.Action_friend:Clone()\n        TeleportButton.Name = \"Action_teleport\"\n        TeleportButton.Label.Text = \"Teleport\"\n        TeleportButton.Icon.Text = \"\u00bb\"\n        TeleportButton.LayoutOrder = 7\n        TeleportButton:SetAttribute(\"BaseColor\", WHITE)\n        TeleportButton:SetAttribute(\"HoverColor\", WHITE)\n        TeleportButton.Label.TextColor3 = WHITE\n        TeleportButton.Icon.TextColor3 = WHITE\n        TeleportButton.Parent = c.Menu\n\n        TeleportButton.Activated:Connect(function()\n            local target = Players:GetPlayerByUserId(ID)\n            local myChar = LocalPlr.Character\n\n            if target and target.Character and myChar then\n                myChar:PivotTo(target.Character:GetPivot())\n            end\n\n            c:Destroy()\n        end)\n\n        -- SPECTATE\n        local SpecButton = c.Menu.Action_friend:Clone()\n        SpecButton.Name = \"Action_spectate\"\n        SpecButton.Label.Text = spectating and \"Stop Spectating\" or \"Spectate\"\n        SpecButton.Icon.Text = spectating and \"\ud83d\udeab\" or \"\ud83d\udc41\"\n        SpecButton.LayoutOrder = 8\n        SpecButton.Parent = c.Menu\n\n        SpecButton.Activated:Connect(function()\n            local cam = workspace.CurrentCamera\n\n            if spectating then\n                spectating = false\n                local myHum = LocalPlr.Character and LocalPlr.Character:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"Humanoid\")\n                if myHum then cam.CameraSubject = myHum end\n                cam.CameraType = Enum.CameraType.Custom\n                c:Destroy()\n                return\n            end\n\n            local plr = Players:GetPlayerByUserId(ID)\n            local hum = plr and plr.Character and plr.Character:FindFirstChildOfClass(\"Humanoid\")\n            if not hum then return end\n\n            spectating = true\n            cam.CameraSubject = hum\n            cam.CameraType = Enum.CameraType.Custom\n            c:Destroy()\n        end)\n\n        -- Hover (cada bot\u00e3o volta para a pr\u00f3pria cor base)\n        for _, v in pairs(c.Menu:GetChildren()) do\n            if v:IsA(\"ImageButton\") then\n                local base = v:GetAttribute(\"BaseColor\") or TEXT_COLOR\n                local hover = v:GetAttribute(\"HoverColor\") or WHITE\n\n                v.MouseEnter:Connect(function()\n                    v.Label.TextColor3 = hover\n                    v.Icon.TextColor3 = hover\n                end)\n\n                v.MouseLeave:Connect(function()\n                    v.Label.TextColor3 = base\n                    v.Icon.TextColor3 = base\n                end)\n            end\n        end\n    end\nend)\n\n--------------------------------------------------\n-- TAB ESCONDE / MOSTRA\n--------------------------------------------------\n\nUserInputService.InputBegan:Connect(function(input, processed)\n    if not processed and input.KeyCode == Enum.KeyCode.Tab then\n        Container.Visible = not Container.Visible\n    end\nend)\n```\n\n## Se os likes ainda n\u00e3o funcionarem\nTeste com 2 jogadores, tente curtir e me diga **o que aparece no bot\u00e3o** e **o que aparece no Output** (as linhas que come\u00e7am com `[PlayerLikes]` ou `[Like]`). Com isso eu identifico o problema na hora:\n\n| O que voc\u00ea v\u00ea | Significado |\n|---|---|\n| Bot\u00e3o \"\ud83d\udc4dLike\" **n\u00e3o aparece** | Remotes n\u00e3o chegaram ao cliente. O script `PlayerLikes` n\u00e3o est\u00e1 rodando como Script em ServerScriptService. |\n| Bot\u00e3o vira `\ud83d\udc4dErro` e o Output mostra \"DataStore falhou\" | API Services desligado no Studio, ou DataStore indispon\u00edvel. |\n| Bot\u00e3o vira `\ud83d\udc4dLiked`, mas a coluna Likes n\u00e3o sobe | O valor est\u00e1 sendo gravado, mas o stat `Likes` n\u00e3o est\u00e1 chegando ao cliente. Pode ser conflito com o seu 