teams, spawn, respawn, remotes, dados iniciais)\n- modelo MK19 j\u00e1 existe em ReplicatedStorage/Turrets/MK19 (partes Swivel e Yaw); n\u00e3o recriar, turrets constru\u00eddas ficam em Workspace/PlacedTurrets\n- leaderboard pr\u00f3pria (Fase 2) baseada no meu script original PlayerListReskin, sem CoreGui; cores BgColor, SELF_COLOR, FRIEND_COLOR; ver [[roblox-playerlist]]\n", "wikilinks": ["roblox-playerlist"], "wikilink_refs": [{"text": "roblox-playerlist", "resolved_path": null}], "body_has_rewritten_wikilinks": false, "blocks": null}, "target": {"file_path": "/projects/01a13278-b9a6-73d1-b303-96130fa900dd/areas/infection-survival.md", "files_list": false}, "memory_op_kind": "write"}, "meta": null, "message": "Mem\u00f3ria atualizada", "integration_name": "Memory", "mcp_server_url": null, "integration_icon_url": null, "icon_name": "edit", "display_content": {"type": "rich_content", "content": [{"title": "/projects/01a13278-b9a6-73d1-b303-96130fa900dd/areas/infection-survival.md", "subtitles": ["---\nname: infection-survival\ndescription: Projeto Roblox \"Infection Survival\" (L\u2026"], "url": null, "resource_type": null, "icon_url": null, "source": null}]}, "hidden_in_chat": null, "tool_origin": "first_party"}, {"start_timestamp": "2026-11-02T17:17:57.585764Z", "stop_timestamp": "2026-11-02T17:18:39.335144Z", "flags": null, "type": "text", "text": "# FASE 1 \u2014 FUNDA\u00c7\u00c3O\n\n## Objetos a criar manualmente no Studio\n\n```text\nReplicatedStorage\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 Modules (Folder)\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 Config (Folder)   -> GameConfig (ModuleScript)\n    \u2514\u2500\u2500 Shared (Folder)   -> Remotes (ModuleScript)\n\nServerScriptService\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 Main (Script)\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 Services (Folder)     -> TeamService, SpawnService, DataService, PlayerService (ModuleScripts)\n\nStarterPlayer/StarterPlayerScripts\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 ClientBootstrap (LocalScript)\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 Controllers (Folder)  -> DataController (ModuleScript)\n```\n\nCriados automaticamente: `ReplicatedStorage/Remotes` (com as subpastas), as pastas do Workspace, os `Team` no servi\u00e7o Teams e `SpawnLocation` placeholders. `ReplicatedStorage/Turrets/MK19` n\u00e3o \u00e9 tocado.\n\n---\n\n### `ReplicatedStorage/Modules/Config/GameConfig` (ModuleScript)\n\n```lua\n-- Configura\u00e7\u00e3o central do jogo (Fase 1)\nlocal GameConfig = {}\n\nGameConfig.Debug = true\n\n-- Equipes; Infection n\u00e3o \u00e9 atribu\u00edda a jogadores nesta fase\nGameConfig.Teams = {\n\tSurvivor = { Name = \"Survivor\", TeamColor = BrickColor.new(\"Bright blue\"), PlaceholderSpawn = Vector3.new(0, 0.5, 0) },\n\tInfection = { Name = \"Infection\", TeamColor = BrickColor.new(\"Bright red\"), PlaceholderSpawn = Vector3.new(80, 0.5, 0) },\n}\nGameConfig.DefaultTeam = \"Survivor\"\n\nGameConfig.Spawn = {\n\tFolderName = \"Spawns\",\n\tRespawnTime = 5, -- segundos at\u00e9 renascer\n\tProtectionTime = 3, -- ForceField ap\u00f3s nascer\n}\n\n-- Pastas criadas automaticamente em Workspace\nGameConfig.WorkspaceFolders = {\n\t\"Map\", \"InfectionAreas\", \"PlacedBuildings\", \"PlacedTurrets\", \"Monsters\", \"Infection\",\n}\n\nGameConfig.Data = {\n\tStoreName = \"InfectionSurvival_PlayerData_v1\",\n\tSchemaVersion = 1,\n\tAutosaveInterval = 120,\n\tMaxRetries = 5,\n\tRetryBaseDelay = 1,\n\tLockTimeout = 90, -- segundos para considerar um lock de sess\u00e3o expirado\n\tLockRetries = 3,\n\tLockRetryDelay = 6,\n}\n\n-- Dados permanentes (nada de estado tempor\u00e1rio de partida)\nGameConfig.DefaultData = {\n\tLevel = 1,\n\tXP = 0,\n\tXPRequired = 100,\n\tKills = 0,\n\tCredits = 100,\n\tInventory = {},\n\tUnlockedWeapons = { \"Pistol\" }, -- nomes provis\u00f3rios\n\tUnlockedBuildings = { \"Wall\" }, -- nomes provis\u00f3rios\n\tUnlockedEquipment = {},\n}\n\nreturn GameConfig\n```\n\n### `ReplicatedStorage/Modules/Shared/Remotes` (ModuleScript)\n\n```lua\n-- Cria (servidor) e localiza (servidor/cliente) todos os remotes\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\nlocal RunService = game:GetService(\"RunService\")\n\nlocal Remotes = {}\n\nlocal ROOT_NAME = \"Remotes\"\nlocal DEFINITIONS = {\n\tPlayerData = { Events = { \"DataLoaded\", \"DataChanged\" }, Functions = { \"RequestData\" } },\n\tCombat = { Events = {}, Functions = {} },\n\tBuilding = { Events = {}, Functions = {} },\n\tShop = { Events = {}, Functions = {} },\n\tInfection = { Events = {}, Functions = {} },\n}\n\nlocal function ensure(parent: Instance, className: string, name: string): Instance\n\tlocal found = parent:FindFirstChild(name)\n\tif found and found.ClassName == className then\n\t\treturn found\n\tend\n\tif found then\n\t\tfound:Destroy()\n\tend\n\tlocal obj = Instance.new(className)\n\tobj.Name = name\n\tobj.Parent = parent\n\treturn obj\nend\n\n-- Somente servidor\nfunction Remotes.Init()\n\tassert(RunService:IsServer(), \"Remotes.Init s\u00f3 no servidor\")\n\tlocal root = ensure(ReplicatedStorage, \"Folder\", ROOT_NAME)\n\tfor category, def in pairs(DEFINITIONS) do\n\t\tlocal folder = ensure(root, \"Folder\", category)\n\t\tfor _, name in ipairs(def.Events) do\n\t\t\tensure(folder, \"RemoteEvent\", name)\n\t\tend\n\t\tfor _, name in ipairs(def.Functions) do\n\t\t\tensure(folder, \"RemoteFunction\", name)\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\n\nfunction Remotes.Get(category: string, name: string): Instance\n\tlocal root = ReplicatedStorage:WaitForChild(ROOT_NAME, 15)\n\tlocal folder = root and root:WaitForChild(category, 15)\n\tlocal remote = folder and folder:WaitForChild(name, 15)\n\tassert(remote, (\"Remote inexistente: %s/%s\"):format(category, name))\n\treturn remote\nend\n\nreturn Remotes\n```\n\n---\n\n### `ServerScriptService/Main` (Script)\n\n```lua\n-- Bootstrap do servidor: ordem de inicializa\u00e7\u00e3o dos servi\u00e7os\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\nlocal Workspace = game:GetService(\"Workspace\")\n\nlocal Modules = ReplicatedStorage:WaitForChild(\"Modules\")\nlocal GameConfig = require(Modules.Config.GameConfig)\nlocal Remotes = require(Modules.Shared.Remotes)\n\nlocal Services = script.Parent:WaitForChild(\"Services\")\nlocal TeamService = require(Services.TeamService)\nlocal SpawnService = require(Services.SpawnService)\nlocal DataService = require(Services.DataService)\nlocal PlayerService = require(Services.PlayerService)\n\nRemotes.Init()\n\nfor _, name in ipairs(GameConfig.WorkspaceFolders) do\n\tif not Workspace:FindFirstChild(name) then\n\t\tlocal folder = Instance.new(\"Folder\")\n\t\tfolder.Name = name\n\t\tfolder.Parent = Workspace\n\tend\nend\n\nTeamService.Init()\nSpawnService.Init()\nDataService.Init()\nPlayerService.Init() -- por \u00faltimo: come\u00e7a a processar jogadores\n```\n\n### `ServerScriptService/Services/TeamService` (ModuleScript)\n\n```lua\nlocal Teams = game:GetService(\"Teams\")\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\n\nlocal GameConfig = require(ReplicatedStorage.Modules.Config.GameConfig)\n\nlocal TeamService = {}\nlocal teamObjects: { [string]: Team } = {}\n\nfunction TeamService.Init()\n\tfor id, def in pairs(GameConfig.Teams) do\n\t\tlocal team = Teams:FindFirstChild(def.Name)\n\t\tif not team or not team:IsA(\"Team\") then\n\t\t\tteam = Instance.new(\"Team\")\n\t\t\tteam.Name = def.Name\n\t\t\tteam.Parent = Teams\n\t\tend\n\t\tteam.TeamColor = def.TeamColor\n\t\tteam.AutoAssignable = false -- o servidor decide a equipe\n\t\tteamObjects[id] = team\n\tend\nend\n\nfunction TeamService.SetTeam(player: Player, teamId: string): boolean\n\tlocal team = teamObjects[teamId]\n\tif not team then\n\t\twarn(\"[TeamService] Equipe inv\u00e1lida:\", teamId)\n\t\treturn false\n\tend\n\tplayer.Team = team\n\treturn true\nend\n\nfunction TeamService.GetTeamId(player: Player): string?\n\tfor id, team in pairs(teamObjects) do\n\t\tif player.Team == team then\n\t\t\treturn id\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\treturn nil\nend\n\nreturn TeamService\n```\n\n### `ServerScriptService/Services/SpawnService` (ModuleScript)\n\n```lua\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal Workspace = game:GetService(\"Workspace\")\nlocal Debris = game:GetService(\"Debris\")\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\n\nlocal GameConfig = require(ReplicatedStorage.Modules.Config.GameConfig)\n\nlocal SpawnService = {}\n\n-- Cria SpawnLocation placeholder s\u00f3 se a equipe n\u00e3o tiver nenhum no mapa\nlocal function ensureSpawns()\n\tlocal folder = Workspace:FindFirstChild(GameConfig.Spawn.FolderName)\n\tif not folder then\n\t\tfolder = Instance.new(\"Folder\")\n\t\tfolder.Name = GameConfig.Spawn.FolderName\n\t\tfolder.Parent = Workspace\n\tend\n\n\tfor id, def in pairs(GameConfig.Teams) do\n\t\tlocal found = false\n\t\tfor _, inst in ipairs(Workspace:GetDescendants()) do\n\t\t\tif inst:IsA(\"SpawnLocation\") and not inst.Neutral and inst.TeamColor == def.TeamColor then\n\t\t\t\tfound = true\n\t\t\t\tbreak\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\t\tif not found then\n\t\t\tlocal spawn = Instance.new(\"SpawnLocation\")\n\t\t\tspawn.Name = id .. \"Spawn\"\n\t\t\tspawn.Anchored = true\n\t\t\tspawn.Size = Vector3.new(12, 1, 12)\n\t\t\tspawn.Position = def.PlaceholderSpawn\n\t\t\tspawn.Neutral = false\n\t\t\tspawn.TeamColor = def.TeamColor\n\t\t\tspawn.BrickColor = def.TeamColor\n\t\t\tspawn.AllowTeamChangeOnTouch = false\n\t\t\tspawn.Duration = 0 -- prote\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 controlada por este servi\u00e7o\n\t\t\tspawn.Parent = folder\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\n\nlocal function applyProtection(character: Model)\n\tlocal time = GameConfig.Spawn.ProtectionTime\n\tif time <= 0 then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tlocal ff = Instance.new(\"ForceField\")\n\tff.Parent = character\n\tDebris:AddItem(ff, time)\nend\n\nfunction SpawnService.Init()\n\tPlayers.CharacterAutoLoads = false -- respawn controlado pelo servidor\n\tensureSpawns()\nend\n\nfunction SpawnService.Spawn(player: Player)\n\tif not player.Parent then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tlocal ok, err = pcall(function()\n\t\tplayer:LoadCharacter()\n\tend)\n\tif not ok then\n\t\twarn(\"[SpawnService] Falha ao carregar personagem:\", err)\n\tend\nend\n\n-- Liga prote\u00e7\u00e3o de spawn e respawn autom\u00e1tico ap\u00f3s a morte\nfunction SpawnService.Track(player: Player)\n\tplayer.CharacterAdded:Connect(function(character)\n\t\tlocal humanoid = character:WaitForChild(\"Humanoid\", 10)\n\t\tif not humanoid then\n\t\t\treturn\n\t\tend\n\t\tapplyProtection(character)\n\n\t\thumanoid.Died:Once(function()\n\t\t\ttask.delay(GameConfig.Spawn.RespawnTime, function()\n\t\t\t\tif player.Parent and (player.Character == character or player.Character == nil) then\n\t\t\t\t\tSpawnService.Spawn(player)\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend)\n\t\tend)\n\tend)\nend\n\nreturn SpawnService\n```\n\n### `ServerScriptService/Services/DataService` (ModuleScript)\n\n```lua\n-- DataStore com retry, lock de sess\u00e3o, autosave, valida\u00e7\u00e3o e BindToClose\nlocal DataStoreService = game:GetService(\"DataStoreService\")\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal RunService = game:GetService(\"RunService\")\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\n\nlocal GameConfig = require(ReplicatedStorage.Modules.Config.GameConfig)\nlocal Remotes = require(ReplicatedStorage.Modules.Shared.Remotes)\n\nlocal cfg = GameConfig.Data\nlocal DataService = {}\n\nlocal store\nlocal sessions = {} -- [Player] = { Data, ReadOnly, Releasing }\n\nlocal function deepCopy(value)\n\tif type(value) ~= \"table\" then\n\t\treturn value\n\tend\n\tlocal copy = {}\n\tfor k, v in pairs(value) do\n\t\tcopy[k] = deepCopy(v)\n\tend\n\treturn copy\nend\n\nlocal function isValidNumber(v): boolean\n\treturn type(v) == \"number\" and v == v and v >= 0 and v < math.huge\nend\n\nlocal function sanitizeList(value): { string }?\n\tif type(value) ~= \"table\" then\n\t\treturn nil\n\tend\n\tlocal list, seen = {}, {}\n\tfor _, item in ipairs(value) do\n\t\tif type(item) == \"string\" and not seen[item] then\n\t\t\tseen[item] = true\n\t\t\ttable.insert(list, item)\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\treturn list\nend\n\n-- Garante que os dados tenham exatamente o formato esperado\nlocal function reconcile(raw)\n\tlocal source = type(raw) == \"table\" and raw or {}\n\tlocal result = {}\n\tfor key, default in pairs(GameConfig.DefaultData) do\n\t\tlocal value = source[key]\n\t\tif type(default) == \"number\" then\n\t\t\tresult[key] = isValidNumber(value) and math.floor(value) or default\n\t\telseif type(default) == \"table\" then\n\t\t\tresult[key] = sanitizeList(value) or deepCopy(default)\n\t\telse\n\t\t\tresult[key] = default\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\tresult.Level = math.max(1, result.Level)\n\tresult.XPRequired = math.max(1, result.XPRequired)\n\treturn result\nend\n\nlocal function sessionKey(player: Player): string\n\treturn \"Player_\" .. player.UserId\nend\n\nlocal function lockedByOther(record): boolean\n\tif type(record) ~= \"table\" or type(record.SessionLock) ~= \"table\" then\n\t\treturn false\n\tend\n\tlocal lock = record.SessionLock\n\treturn lock.JobId ~= game.JobId and (os.time() - (lock.Time or 0)) < cfg.LockTimeout\nend\n\nlocal function retry(fn, label: string, maxRetries: number)\n\tfor attempt = 1, maxRetries do\n\t\tlocal ok, result = pcall(fn)\n\t\tif ok then\n\t\t\treturn true, result\n\t\tend\n\t\twarn((\"[DataService] %s falhou (%d/%d): %s\"):format(label, attempt, maxRetries, tostring(result)))\n\t\tif attempt < maxRetries then\n\t\t\ttask.wait(cfg.RetryBaseDelay * 2 ^ (attempt - 1))\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\treturn false, nil\nend\n\nfunction DataService.Init()\n\tlocal ok, result = pcall(function()\n\t\treturn DataStoreService:GetDataStore(cfg.StoreName)\n\tend)\n\tif ok then\n\t\tstore = result\n\telse\n\t\twarn(\"[DataService] DataStore indispon\u00edvel:\", result)\n\tend\n\n\t-- Autosave peri\u00f3dico\n\ttask.spawn(function()\n\t\twhile true do\n\t\t\ttask.wait(cfg.AutosaveInterval)\n\t\t\tfor player, session in pairs(sessions) do\n\t\t\t\tif not session.ReadOnly and not session.Releasing then\n\t\t\t\t\ttask.spawn(DataService.Save, player, false, cfg.MaxRetries)\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tend\n\t\tend\n\tend)\n\n\t-- Salva todos ao fechar o servidor\n\tgame:BindToClose(function()\n\t\tlocal list = {}\n\t\tfor player in pairs(sessions) do\n\t\t\ttable.insert(list, player)\n\t\tend\n\t\tfor _, player in ipairs(list) do\n\t\t\ttask.spawn(DataService.Release, player, 2)\n\t\tend\n\t\tlocal startTime = os.clock()\n\t\twhile next(sessions) ~= nil and os.clock() - startTime < 25 do\n\t\t\ttask.wait(0.1)\n\t\tend\n\tend)\n\n\tPlayers.PlayerRemoving:Connect(function(player)\n\t\tDataService.Release(player)\n\tend)\nend\n\n-- Retorna \"Loaded\", \"Temporary\" (Studio sem acesso \u00e0 API) ou \"Failed\"\nfunction DataService.Load(player: Player): string\n\tif not store then\n\t\tif RunService:IsStudio() then\n\t\t\tsessions[player] = { Data = reconcile(nil), ReadOnly = true }\n\t\t\treturn \"Temporary\"\n\t\tend\n\t\treturn \"Failed\"\n\tend\n\n\tlocal maxRetries = RunService:IsStudio() and 1 or cfg.MaxRetries\n\n\tfor _ = 1, cfg.LockRetries do\n\t\tlocal locked = false\n\t\tlocal ok, result = retry(function()\n\t\t\treturn store:UpdateAsync(sessionKey(player), function(old)\n\t\t\t\tlocked = false\n\t\t\t\tif lockedByOther(old) then\n\t\t\t\t\tlocked = true\n\t\t\t\t\treturn nil -- cancela a atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o\n\t\t\t\tend\n\t\t\t\tlocal record = type(old) == \"table\" and old or {}\n\t\t\t\trecord.SchemaVersion = cfg.SchemaVersion\n\t\t\t\trecord.Data = reconcile(record.Data)\n\t\t\t\trecord.SessionLock = { JobId = game.JobId, Time = os.time() }\n\t\t\t\treturn record\n\t\t\tend)\n\t\tend, \"Load \" .. player.Name, maxRetries)\n\n\t\tif not ok then\n\t\t\tbreak\n\t\tend\n\t\tif locked then\n\t\t\ttask.wait(cfg.LockRetryDelay)\n\t\telseif type(result) == \"table\" then\n\t\t\tsessions[player] = { Data = reconcile(result.Data), ReadOnly = false }\n\t\t\treturn \"Loaded\"\n\t\telse\n\t\t\tbreak\n\t\tend\n\tend\n\n\tif RunService:IsStudio() then\n\t\tsessions[player] = { Data = reconcile(nil), ReadOnly = true } -- nunca sobrescreve dados reais\n\t\treturn \"Temporary\"\n\tend\n\treturn \"Failed\"\nend\n\nfunction DataService.Save(player: Player, release: boolean?, maxRetries: number?): boolean\n\tlocal session = sessions[player]\n\tif not session or session.ReadOnly or not store then\n\t\treturn false\n\tend\n\tlocal snapshot = deepCopy(session.Data)\n\tlocal lostLock = false\n\n\tlocal ok = retry(function()\n\t\treturn store:UpdateAsync(sessionKey(player), function(old)\n\t\t\tlostLock = false\n\t\t\tif lockedByOther(old) then\n\t\t\t\tlostLock = true\n\t\t\t\treturn nil\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tlocal record = type(old) == \"table\" and old or {}\n\t\t\trecord.SchemaVersion = cfg.SchemaVersion\n\t\t\trecord.Data = snapshot\n\t\t\tif release then\n\t\t\t\trecord.SessionLock = nil\n\t\t\telse\n\t\t\t\trecord.SessionLock = { JobId = game.JobId, Time = os.time() }\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\treturn record\n\t\tend)\n\tend, \"Save \" .. player.Name, maxRetries or cfg.MaxRetries)\n\n\tif lostLock then\n\t\twarn(\"[DataService] Lock perdido, save descartado:\", player.Name)\n\t\treturn false\n\tend\n\treturn ok\nend\n\n-- Salva com libera\u00e7\u00e3o de lock e remove a sess\u00e3o (idempotente)\nfunction DataService.Release(player: Player, maxRetries: number?)\n\tlocal session = sessions[player]\n\tif not session or session.Releasing then\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\tsession.Releasing = true\n\tDataService.Save(player, true, maxRetries)\n\tsessions[player] = nil\nend\n\nfunction DataService.IsLoaded(player: Player): boolean\n\treturn sessions[player] ~= nil\nend\n\n-- Refer\u00eancia viva (somente para uso interno de servi\u00e7os do servidor)\nfunction DataService.GetData(player: Player)\n\tlocal session = sessions[player]\n\treturn session and session.Data or nil\nend\n\nfunction DataService.GetCopy(player: Player)\n\tlocal session = sessions[player]\n\treturn session and deepCopy(session.Data) or nil\nend\n\n-- \u00danico ponto de escrita: valida tipo e notifica o cliente dono\nfunction DataService.Set(player: Player, key: string, value: any): boolean\n\tlocal session = sessions[player]\n\tlocal default = GameConfig.DefaultData[key]\n\tif not session or default == nil then\n\t\treturn false\n\tend\n\n\tlocal clean\n\tif type(default) == \"number\" then\n\t\tif not isValidNumber(value) then\n\t\t\treturn false\n\t\tend\n\t\tclean = math.floor(value)\n\telseif type(default) == \"table\" then\n\t\tclean = sanitizeList(value)\n\t\tif not clean then\n\t\t\treturn false\n\t\tend\n\telse\n\t\treturn false\n\tend\n\n\tsession.Data[key] = clean\n\tRemotes.Get(\"PlayerData\", \"DataChanged\"):FireClient(player, key, deepCopy(clean))\n\treturn true\nend\n\nreturn DataService\n```\n\n### `ServerScriptService/Services/PlayerService` (ModuleScript)\n\n```lua\n-- Ciclo de vida do jogador: dados -> equipe -> spawn\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\nlocal ServerScriptService = game:GetService(\"ServerScriptService\")\n\nlocal GameConfig = require(ReplicatedStorage.Modules.Config.GameConfig)\nlocal Remotes = require(ReplicatedStorage.Modules.Shared.Remotes)\n\nlocal Services = ServerScriptService:WaitForChild(\"Services\")\nlocal DataService = require(Services.DataService)\nlocal TeamService = require(Services.TeamService)\nlocal SpawnService = require(Services.SpawnService)\n\nlocal PlayerService = {}\nlocal lastRequest: { [Player]: number } = {}\n\nlocal function onPlayerAdded(player: Player)\n\tlocal status = DataService.Load(player)\n\tif status == \"Failed\" then\n\t\tplayer:Kick(\"N\u00e3o foi poss\u00edvel carregar seus dados. Tente entrar novamente.\")\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\t-- Saiu durante o carregamento: libera o lock\n\tif not player.Parent then\n\t\tDataService.Release(player)\n\t\treturn\n\tend\n\n\tTeamService.SetTeam(player, GameConfig.DefaultTeam)\n\tplayer:SetAttribute(\"DataLoaded\", true)\n\tRemotes.Get(\"PlayerData\", \"DataLoaded\"):FireClient(player, DataService.GetCopy(player))\n\n\tSpawnService.Track(player)\n\tSpawnService.Spawn(player)\nend\n\nfunction PlayerService.Init()\n\t-- O cliente s\u00f3 pode pedir os PR\u00d3PRIOS dados, com limite de frequ\u00eancia\n\tlocal requestData = Remotes.Get(\"PlayerData\", \"RequestData\") :: RemoteFunction\n\trequestData.OnServerInvoke = function(player)\n\t\tlocal now = os.clock()\n\t\tif lastRequest[player] and now - lastRequest[player] < 1 then\n\t\t\treturn nil\n\t\tend\n\t\tlastRequest[player] = now\n\t\treturn DataService.GetCopy(player)\n\tend\n\n\tPlayers.PlayerRemoving:Connect(function(player)\n\t\tlastRequest[player] = nil\n\tend)\n\n\tPlayers.PlayerAdded:Connect(onPlayerAdded)\n\tfor _, player in ipairs(Players:GetPlayers()) do\n\t\ttask.spawn(onPlayerAdded, player)\n\tend\nend\n\nreturn PlayerService\n```\n\n---\n\n### `StarterPlayer/StarterPlayerScripts/Controllers/DataController` (ModuleScript)\n\n```lua\n-- Estado local dos dados do jogador (somente leitura; o servidor \u00e9 a autoridade)\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\nlocal Remotes = require(ReplicatedStorage:WaitForChild(\"Modules\"):WaitForChild(\"Shared\"):WaitForChild(\"Remotes\"))\n\nlocal DataController = {}\n\nlocal data = nil\nlocal loadedEvent = Instance.new(\"BindableEvent\")\nlocal changedEvent = Instance.new(\"BindableEvent\")\n\nDataController.Loaded = loadedEvent.Event -- (data)\nDataController.Changed = changedEvent.Event -- (key, value)\n\nfunction DataController.Init()\n\tlocal dataLoaded = Remotes.Get(\"PlayerData\", \"DataLoaded\") :: RemoteEvent\n\tlocal dataChanged = Remotes.Get(\"PlayerData\", \"DataChanged\") :: RemoteEvent\n\tlocal requestData = Remotes.Get(\"PlayerData\", \"RequestData\") :: RemoteFunction\n\n\tdataLoaded.OnClientEvent:Connect(function(newData)\n\t\tdata = newData\n\t\tloadedEvent:Fire(data)\n\tend)\n\n\tdataChanged.OnClientEvent:Connect(function(key, value)\n\t\tif data then\n\t\t\tdata[key] = value\n\t\t\tchangedEvent:Fire(key, value)\n\t\tend\n\tend)\n\n\t-- Cobre o caso do evento ter sido disparado antes da conex\u00e3o\n\ttask.spawn(function()\n\t\tfor _ = 1, 10 do\n\t\t\tif data then\n\t\t\t\treturn\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\tlocal ok, result = pcall(function()\n\t\t\t\treturn requestData:InvokeServer()\n\t\t\tend)\n\t\t\tif ok and result and not data then\n\t\t\t\tdata = result\n\t\t\t\tloadedEvent:Fire(data)\n\t\t\t\treturn\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\ttask.wait(2)\n\t\tend\n\tend)\nend\n\nfunction DataController.Get(key: string)\n\treturn data and data[key] or nil\nend\n\nfunction DataController.IsLoaded(): boolean\n\treturn data ~= nil\nend\n\nreturn DataController\n```\n\n### `StarterPlayer/StarterPlayerScripts/ClientBootstrap` (LocalScript)\n\n```lua\nlocal ReplicatedStorage = game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\")\nlocal GameConfig = require(ReplicatedStorage:WaitForChild(\"Modules\"):WaitForChild(\"Config\"):WaitForChild(\"GameConfig\"))\nlocal DataController = require(script.Parent:WaitForChild(\"Controllers\"):WaitForChild(\"DataController\"))\n\nDataController.Init()\n\nif GameConfig.Debug then\n\tDataController.Loaded:Connect(function(data)\n\t\tprint((\"[Client] Dados carregados: Level %d | XP %d/%d | Kills %d | Credits %d\"):format(\n\t\t\tdata.Level, data.XP, data.XPRequired, data.Kills, data.Credits))\n\tend)\n\tDataController.Changed:Connect(function(key, value)\n\t\tprint(\"[Client] Dado alterado:\", key, value)\n\tend)\nend\n```\n\n---\n\n## Instala\u00e7\u00e3o\nCrie a \u00e1rvore acima, cole cada script no objeto de mesmo nome e tipo e, em Studio, ative **Game Settings > Security > Enable Studio Access to API Services** para testar o DataStore.\n\n## Testes a executar (n\u00e3o executei nada no Studio)\n1. Play: o jogador entra na equipe Survivor, nasce e recebe ForceField por 3 s.\n2. Output do cliente mostra `Dados carregados: Level 1 ...`.\n3. Reset do personagem: renasce ap\u00f3s 5 s.\n4. Teste Local Server com 2+ jogadores: cada um recebe apenas seus dados.\n5. Execute `DataService.Set(player