rstChild(\"Systems\")\n   176\t\n   177\tlocal loaded: { [string]: any } = {}\n   178\tif Systems then\n   179\t\tfor _, child in Systems:GetChildren() do\n   180\t\t\tif child:IsA(\"ModuleScript\") then\n   181\t\t\t\tloaded[child.Name] = require(child)\n   182\t\t\tend\n   183\t\tend\n   184\tend\n   185\t\n   186\tfor _, system in loaded do\n   187\t\tif typeof(system.init) == \"function\" then\n   188\t\t\tsystem.init()\n   189\t\tend\n   190\tend\n   191\t\n   192\tfor _, system in loaded do\n   193\t\tif typeof(system.start) == \"function\" then\n   194\t\t\ttask.spawn(system.start)\n   195\t\tend\n   196\tend\n   197\t\n   198\tprint(\"[{{NAME}}] server started\")\n   199\t```\n   200\t\n   201\t## src/client/init.client.luau\n   202\t\n   203\t```lua\n   204\t--!strict\n   205\t-- {{NAME}} client entry point.\n   206\t\n   207\tlocal Controllers = script:FindFirstChild(\"Controllers\")\n   208\t\n   209\tlocal loaded: { [string]: any } = {}\n   210\tif Controllers then\n   211\t\tfor _, child in Controllers:GetChildren() do\n   212\t\t\tif child:IsA(\"ModuleScript\") then\n   213\t\t\t\tloaded[child.Name] = require(child)\n   214\t\t\tend\n   215\t\tend\n   216\tend\n   217\t\n   218\tfor _, controller in loaded do\n   219\t\tif typeof(controller.init) == \"function\" then\n   220\t\t\tcontroller.init()\n   221\t\tend\n   222\tend\n   223\t\n   224\tfor _, controller in loaded do\n   225\t\tif typeof(controller.start) == \"function\" then\n   226\t\t\ttask.spawn(controller.start)\n   227\t\tend\n   228\tend\n   229\t\n   230\tprint(\"[{{NAME}}] client started\")\n   231\t```\n   232\t\n   233\t## README.md (project)\n   234\t\n   235\t```markdown\n   236\t# {{NAME}}\n   237\t\n   238\tRoblox game built with [Rojo](https://rojo.space).\n   239\t\n   240\t## Development\n   241\t\n   242\t1. Install the toolchain: `rokit install`\n   243\t2. Start syncing: `rojo serve`\n   244\t3. In Roblox Studio, connect with the Rojo plugin.\n   245\t\n   246\t## Structure\